WEBVTT

1
00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:12.074
Tired of searching for subtitles?
Ray generates them instantly: getray.app

2
00:01:03.666 --> 00:01:05.916
<i>911. What's your emergency?</i>

3
00:01:06.833 --> 00:01:08.000
<i>Hello?</i>

4
00:01:10.166 --> 00:01:12.166
<i>This is 911. Go ahead.</i>

5
00:01:13.333 --> 00:01:16.833
This is Suh Young-chul. who
used to work at Chains Bio.

6
00:01:17.583 --> 00:01:21.916
Today at the Doongwoori Building
I plan to run an experiment.

7
00:01:22.333 --> 00:01:25.000
<i>Excuse me? Can you repeat that. please?</i>

8
00:01:25.083 --> 00:01:27.416
Ah. not an experiment.

9
00:01:27.666 --> 00:01:29.083
It's closer to terrorism.

10
00:01:29.250 --> 00:01:30.166
<i>What?</i>

11
00:01:30.250 --> 00:01:35.166
That's right. A highly
contagious bioterror attack.

12
00:01:38.833 --> 00:01:41.666
I tested the pathogen in my body.

13
00:01:48.250 --> 00:01:50.166
And it was a success.

14
00:01:51.583 --> 00:01:55.833
I am the only vaccine that
can stop this outbreak.

15
00:01:57.726 --> 00:01:59.225
<i>COLONY</i>

16
00:01:59.250 --> 00:02:01.333
<i>Organisms of the same species that.</i>

17
00:02:01.333 --> 00:02:03.583
<i>for a certain time.
live in the same place.</i>

18
00:02:17.916 --> 00:02:19.500
Why are you waiting for me?

19
00:02:20.833 --> 00:02:23.666
You're 10 minutes late.
What was it this time?

20
00:02:24.666 --> 00:02:26.000
It was nothing.

21
00:02:26.083 --> 00:02:26.916
Traffic was bad

22
00:02:26.916 --> 00:02:29.333
so the taxi driver tried to
let me off across the street.

23
00:02:29.333 --> 00:02:30.083
So?

24
00:02:31.333 --> 00:02:33.500
Yeah. these things happen.

25
00:02:34.333 --> 00:02:37.583
It's okay if I say it. but
how can he say that to me?

26
00:02:37.833 --> 00:02:38.750
So?

27
00:02:40.916 --> 00:02:42.333
It's not what I wanted.

28
00:02:42.583 --> 00:02:44.333
I said. however long it takes.

29
00:02:44.333 --> 00:02:46.250
drop me off at the spot I chose.

30
00:02:50.833 --> 00:02:51.750
What?

31
00:02:52.583 --> 00:02:54.416
So it's my fault again?

32
00:02:54.666 --> 00:02:56.833
<i>Welcome to the Chains Bio Conference.</i>

33
00:02:56.833 --> 00:02:59.250
<i>a leading platform for
future technology.</i>

34
00:02:59.250 --> 00:03:00.333
Thank you.

35
00:03:00.750 --> 00:03:02.750
You brought the invitation I gave you?

36
00:03:03.166 --> 00:03:06.166
...and now we'll hear from
CEO Kang Woo-cheol.

37
00:03:06.166 --> 00:03:08.083
Please give him a round of applause.

38
00:03:14.166 --> 00:03:15.000
Is that the guy?

39
00:03:15.000 --> 00:03:17.666
The one I should grovel
to if I want to work here?

40
00:03:18.633 --> 00:03:21.300
If only you got along with your dean.

41
00:03:21.300 --> 00:03:23.300
this wouldn't be necessary.

42
00:03:24.216 --> 00:03:26.633
Sure. my fault again.

43
00:03:27.550 --> 00:03:29.383
But don't you care how that dean

44
00:03:29.383 --> 00:03:31.050
treated his graduate students?

45
00:03:31.050 --> 00:03:32.466
No. I don't.

46
00:03:32.883 --> 00:03:35.300
Well. I'm sure he's a jerk.

47
00:03:35.550 --> 00:03:37.466
And you couldn't tolerate that.

48
00:03:38.133 --> 00:03:40.550
So you got on his bad side.
and didn't get reappointed.

49
00:03:43.383 --> 00:03:45.466
I'm just curious...

50
00:03:45.966 --> 00:03:48.216
Why are you so fixated
on your ex-wife's career

51
00:03:48.216 --> 00:03:49.633
10 years after the divorce?

52
00:03:51.383 --> 00:03:53.050
Because you have no friends.

53
00:03:53.800 --> 00:03:56.550
You keep doing things
that make people hate you.

54
00:03:56.550 --> 00:03:58.966
Does your wife know you look
after your ex-wife like this?

55
00:03:58.966 --> 00:04:02.466
My wife is not as sensitive as you are.

56
00:04:02.883 --> 00:04:04.966
She's probably even concerned for you.

57
00:04:05.633 --> 00:04:06.883
What a cool wife.

58
00:04:07.383 --> 00:04:10.050
You're a great match.
I'm happy for you.

59
00:04:10.216 --> 00:04:12.800
If I say our company's main business

60
00:04:12.800 --> 00:04:14.716
is collective intelligence.

61
00:04:14.716 --> 00:04:16.133
people might wonder.

62
00:04:16.300 --> 00:04:17.633
"Why is a bio company.

63
00:04:17.633 --> 00:04:20.716
rather than an IT company.
studying that topic?"

64
00:04:22.216 --> 00:04:24.800
Collective intelligence
is a common term

65
00:04:24.800 --> 00:04:26.633
in the field of sociology.

66
00:04:26.800 --> 00:04:29.716
but the first person to use the term

67
00:04:29.883 --> 00:04:32.633
was an entomologist who studied ants.

68
00:04:32.633 --> 00:04:34.383
William Morton Wheeler.

69
00:04:34.716 --> 00:04:37.883
Collective intelligence is a
key force driving evolution.

70
00:04:38.434 --> 00:04:41.518
You know the yellow slime mold
'Physarum polycephalum'?

71
00:04:42.116 --> 00:04:43.700
These fellows upgrade themselves

72
00:04:43.700 --> 00:04:45.116
through information exchange

73
00:04:45.116 --> 00:04:48.283
and optimize the direction
of their growth towards food.

74
00:04:48.783 --> 00:04:50.700
Although not multicellular organisms.

75
00:04:50.700 --> 00:04:52.283
they can learn and remember.

76
00:04:52.900 --> 00:04:55.400
Inspired by these remarkable traits.

77
00:04:55.400 --> 00:04:57.066
we were able to dramatically improve

78
00:04:57.066 --> 00:04:59.066
the production of
organic semiconductors.

79
00:04:59.683 --> 00:05:02.183
Let's give a hand to
our little collaborators.

80
00:05:06.300 --> 00:05:08.800
This guy's more
interesting than I expected.

81
00:05:09.050 --> 00:05:11.800
This isn't some lame company
that makes copycat drugs.

82
00:05:11.883 --> 00:05:13.800
It's a serious. enterprising firm.

83
00:05:14.280 --> 00:05:15.780
After I introduced you.

84
00:05:15.805 --> 00:05:17.972
they even sent another
invitation for you.

85
00:05:19.044 --> 00:05:21.128
Actually. that's why I came.

86
00:05:21.784 --> 00:05:24.108
I was curious what this message meant.

87
00:05:24.133 --> 00:05:26.050
<i>To Prof. Kwon: Imperfect communication.</i>

88
00:05:26.050 --> 00:05:27.300
<i>the source of all tragedy</i>

89
00:05:27.900 --> 00:05:31.150
...so this chip helps damaged
nerves carry information.

90
00:05:31.316 --> 00:05:34.816
We injected it into a rat
with severed spinal nerves

91
00:05:34.816 --> 00:05:36.483
and paralyzed hind legs.

92
00:05:37.266 --> 00:05:40.433
and as you can see.
just a moment later.

93
00:05:41.050 --> 00:05:44.133
it was able to move no
different from a healthy rat.

94
00:05:51.216 --> 00:05:53.133
If we continue with this research.

95
00:05:53.133 --> 00:05:55.383
and apply it to the human brain.

96
00:05:55.633 --> 00:05:58.633
I believe it may enable
a direct transfer

97
00:05:58.716 --> 00:06:01.383
of information between individuals.

98
00:06:02.692 --> 00:06:04.025
When that happens.

99
00:06:04.586 --> 00:06:05.858
we may live in a world where

100
00:06:05.883 --> 00:06:08.966
you can't think bad
thoughts in front of others.

101
00:06:10.866 --> 00:06:12.616
<i>Thank you. CEO Kang.</i>

102
00:06:12.783 --> 00:06:15.200
<i>Please give him a round of applause!</i>

103
00:06:23.133 --> 00:06:25.466
<i>Next. to introduce Chains
Bio's global market strategy...</i>

104
00:06:27.966 --> 00:06:29.133
Whoa!

105
00:06:32.633 --> 00:06:34.550
It's your first vacation in ages.

106
00:06:34.800 --> 00:06:38.300
So why spend it with the younger
brother you see every day?

107
00:06:38.383 --> 00:06:42.550
This way I can get some
fresh air. go shopping...

108
00:06:42.550 --> 00:06:44.883
You know how stifling it is
working at a computer all day?

109
00:06:50.716 --> 00:06:54.300
Wow. look at all the camping
stuff they have these days.

110
00:06:54.383 --> 00:06:55.966
I could just live outdoors.

111
00:06:57.216 --> 00:06:58.633
The clothes are nice. too.

112
00:07:00.550 --> 00:07:02.800
Should we go camping?
On your next vacation?

113
00:07:03.466 --> 00:07:05.800
- The two of us?
- Yeah. let's go.

114
00:07:06.050 --> 00:07:07.383
We'll grill some meat..

115
00:07:07.383 --> 00:07:09.050
That'd be great!

116
00:07:09.550 --> 00:07:11.133
We can go. why not?

117
00:07:11.133 --> 00:07:13.633
That's great. I'll buy some equipment.

118
00:07:14.983 --> 00:07:17.316
You get back to work.
Lunchtime will end soon.

119
00:07:17.316 --> 00:07:20.066
- No. I'll head back after you.
- No need.

120
00:07:20.066 --> 00:07:22.650
The facilities here are
great. So convenient.

121
00:07:23.400 --> 00:07:27.733
Don't I work my ass off
so I can live in civilization?

122
00:07:27.933 --> 00:07:30.100
You always go on about civilization.

123
00:07:30.100 --> 00:07:31.933
why do you want to go camping?

124
00:07:32.167 --> 00:07:33.834
Camping is civilization. too.

125
00:07:34.083 --> 00:07:36.083
Go on. See you at home.

126
00:07:36.333 --> 00:07:37.833
I'll look around before going.

127
00:07:38.250 --> 00:07:38.666
Okay.

128
00:07:39.166 --> 00:07:39.833
Bye.

129
00:07:39.833 --> 00:07:41.500
- Take care.
- Yeah.

130
00:07:45.366 --> 00:07:48.033
Hello. sir. I enjoyed
your presentation.

131
00:07:48.341 --> 00:07:49.841
Oh. Professor Han.

132
00:07:50.091 --> 00:07:53.425
This is Professor Kwon Se-jeong.
who I mentioned last time.

133
00:07:53.650 --> 00:07:55.150
Thank you for inviting me.

134
00:07:55.150 --> 00:07:57.650
And for this note on my invitation.

135
00:07:58.850 --> 00:08:00.016
Just a moment.

136
00:08:00.953 --> 00:08:01.991
Hello?

137
00:08:02.216 --> 00:08:03.300
<i>Mr. Kang Woo-cheol?</i>

138
00:08:03.800 --> 00:08:05.466
Yes. Who's speaking?

139
00:08:05.550 --> 00:08:08.216
<i>I'm Lee Bong-seok. from the
Seoul Counterterrorism Squad.</i>

140
00:08:08.300 --> 00:08:09.550
How can I help you?

141
00:08:09.716 --> 00:08:11.383
<i>You know a man named Suh Young-chul?</i>

142
00:08:12.133 --> 00:08:14.716
This call seems important.
Let's talk later.

143
00:08:14.716 --> 00:08:16.800
Ah. sure. We'll wait.

144
00:08:20.616 --> 00:08:22.700
You sure he's the one
who sent this invitation?

145
00:08:22.783 --> 00:08:24.616
What are you doing? Go after him.

146
00:08:24.783 --> 00:08:25.283
What?

147
00:08:25.283 --> 00:08:27.116
Just hand him your card

148
00:08:27.141 --> 00:08:30.391
and say "I'm Kwon
Se-jeong." that's all.

149
00:08:38.311 --> 00:08:40.561
Why are you looking for Dr. Suh?

150
00:08:41.021 --> 00:08:42.105
<i>We received a call</i>

151
00:08:42.130 --> 00:08:44.463
<i>that Dr. Suh is planning
a terrorist attack</i>

152
00:08:44.488 --> 00:08:45.551
<i>in the building hosting
your conference.</i>

153
00:08:49.293 --> 00:08:51.082
I think I saw him
today at the conference.

154
00:08:51.292 --> 00:08:52.004
<i>Are you certain?</i>

155
00:08:53.113 --> 00:08:54.098
Not 100% certain.

156
00:08:54.796 --> 00:08:56.296
He was standing too far away.

157
00:08:56.423 --> 00:08:58.793
<i>Our team will arrive there soon.</i>

158
00:08:58.818 --> 00:09:01.068
<i>If you see him again. call me
immediately at this number.</i>

159
00:09:01.093 --> 00:09:02.510
All right. I will.

160
00:09:28.250 --> 00:09:29.916
Nice speech. Woo-cheol.

161
00:09:30.434 --> 00:09:31.767
So impressive.

162
00:09:32.497 --> 00:09:34.664
Information exchange through
organic semiconductors?

163
00:09:35.544 --> 00:09:38.851
You know how hard I researched that.

164
00:09:40.531 --> 00:09:42.947
Consciousness in a
multilateral network.

165
00:09:43.460 --> 00:09:46.293
Well. if that existed.

166
00:09:46.890 --> 00:09:49.617
no one would be betrayed
and kicked out like me. right?

167
00:09:50.350 --> 00:09:51.683
You freak.

168
00:09:53.100 --> 00:09:56.433
The technology you researched
can't be used anywhere.

169
00:09:58.016 --> 00:09:58.850
Bro.

170
00:09:59.683 --> 00:10:03.016
I'm taking humanity to the next level.

171
00:10:04.516 --> 00:10:07.016
Enabling a second cognitive revolution.

172
00:10:11.874 --> 00:10:13.124
You know what?

173
00:10:13.679 --> 00:10:14.845
You...

174
00:10:15.916 --> 00:10:17.666
are just a psycho.

175
00:10:18.250 --> 00:10:20.333
Get lost. you loser!

176
00:10:25.583 --> 00:10:27.333
But when you hired me.

177
00:10:27.833 --> 00:10:30.250
you said my research was great.

178
00:10:30.416 --> 00:10:32.583
That you respected my research.

179
00:10:33.348 --> 00:10:37.515
It was all just an act. so you
could steal my research.

180
00:10:38.433 --> 00:10:40.183
And now... psycho?

181
00:10:41.148 --> 00:10:43.565
You stole research from that psycho.

182
00:10:44.766 --> 00:10:48.766
You just want to make
humans go extinct. don't you?

183
00:10:49.766 --> 00:10:51.433
Not extinct.

184
00:10:51.600 --> 00:10:52.933
It's a birth.

185
00:10:53.232 --> 00:10:54.898
The birth of a new humanity.

186
00:10:55.276 --> 00:10:56.859
Just imagine it.

187
00:10:57.034 --> 00:10:59.084
Perfect communication will be possible.

188
00:10:59.742 --> 00:11:01.982
All the byproducts of
crass individualism.

189
00:11:02.007 --> 00:11:03.924
jealousy. rivalry. suspicion..

190
00:11:05.990 --> 00:11:08.771
Those bizarre losses that arise
from unstable communication.

191
00:11:09.918 --> 00:11:11.835
That's what I'm trying to stop.

192
00:11:15.267 --> 00:11:15.935
Wow!

193
00:11:19.583 --> 00:11:21.666
You crazy freak.

194
00:11:23.500 --> 00:11:24.583
Give it a try.

195
00:11:24.916 --> 00:11:26.416
It's got nothing to do with me.

196
00:11:26.750 --> 00:11:29.500
I'm clocking out. so
good luck with that.

197
00:11:31.333 --> 00:11:35.750
I want you to be the link between
me and the new humanity.

198
00:11:42.233 --> 00:11:43.316
What the hell are you doing?

199
00:11:43.650 --> 00:11:44.650
Research.

200
00:11:44.650 --> 00:11:46.066
You goddamned maniac!

201
00:12:27.006 --> 00:12:27.788
What's going on?

202
00:12:27.943 --> 00:12:29.193
Hey. look at this.

203
00:12:29.683 --> 00:12:30.683
Hey mister!

204
00:12:30.766 --> 00:12:32.350
Shouldn't we call 911?

205
00:12:51.631 --> 00:12:52.631
Did you talk to him?

206
00:12:53.484 --> 00:12:54.734
Well... no.

207
00:12:55.240 --> 00:12:56.573
Seemed like a bad time.

208
00:12:56.598 --> 00:12:58.598
Really? Just a sec.

209
00:13:00.586 --> 00:13:03.336
No. really. I don't think
he'll want to talk now.

210
00:13:09.916 --> 00:13:12.416
Let's go eat. He'll call back.

211
00:13:24.850 --> 00:13:27.100
Police. Where's the conference hall?

212
00:13:27.125 --> 00:13:29.625
Turn left and go up the stairs. then...

213
00:13:34.683 --> 00:13:35.600
What is that?

214
00:13:39.516 --> 00:13:40.350
Go.

215
00:13:41.516 --> 00:13:42.933
Sir. are you okay?

216
00:13:48.850 --> 00:13:50.266
- Call the containment team.
- What?

217
00:13:50.266 --> 00:13:51.516
Call for a lockdown!

218
00:14:01.110 --> 00:14:01.610
Hi!

219
00:14:02.094 --> 00:14:04.344
<i>Where are you. Daddy?
What are you doing?</i>

220
00:14:04.492 --> 00:14:05.773
I'll head home now.

221
00:14:06.312 --> 00:14:08.453
<i>Honey. where's your passport?</i>

222
00:14:08.729 --> 00:14:10.896
Should be in the drawer in the study.

223
00:14:10.933 --> 00:14:14.143
<i>- You still with Professor Kwon?</i>
- Yeah.

224
00:14:14.620 --> 00:14:15.805
I'll head home soon.

225
00:14:16.662 --> 00:14:17.662
Want to say hi?

226
00:14:21.166 --> 00:14:23.083
<i>Anyway. hurry home. We need to pack.</i>

227
00:14:23.260 --> 00:14:24.010
Okay.

228
00:14:24.035 --> 00:14:26.535
<i>- Say bye to Dad.
- Hurry home. Dad!</i>

229
00:14:28.033 --> 00:14:29.533
Where are you going? Traveling?

230
00:14:33.450 --> 00:14:36.033
Why don't you answer? You
immigrating or something?

231
00:14:36.616 --> 00:14:37.950
Well..

232
00:14:38.450 --> 00:14:40.950
A teaching position
opened at UC Irvine.

233
00:14:41.200 --> 00:14:44.116
Really. you're going to
the US? For how long?

234
00:14:44.866 --> 00:14:47.450
This time. we may just stay there.

235
00:14:54.938 --> 00:14:57.521
Ah. now I get it.

236
00:14:58.166 --> 00:15:00.166
You're leaving. so you wanted to set

237
00:15:00.166 --> 00:15:02.500
your ex-wife up with
a job before going?

238
00:15:03.575 --> 00:15:04.686
Anyway. congrats.

239
00:15:04.960 --> 00:15:06.231
It's good news. right?

240
00:15:09.889 --> 00:15:11.957
Since it's the last time. let me ask.

241
00:15:13.483 --> 00:15:15.400
Why did you marry me?

242
00:15:18.900 --> 00:15:20.483
Well...

243
00:15:21.516 --> 00:15:24.933
The way you never back down
when you think you're right...

244
00:15:24.933 --> 00:15:26.516
your personality?

245
00:15:28.511 --> 00:15:30.183
Wow. after you always
begged me not to do that.

246
00:15:30.633 --> 00:15:31.966
You liked that?

247
00:15:33.464 --> 00:15:36.044
I did... I liked it.

248
00:15:37.252 --> 00:15:38.591
But I couldn't keep up with you.

249
00:15:39.409 --> 00:15:41.409
I couldn't handle it.

250
00:15:41.919 --> 00:15:44.341
I've always been a bit of a coward.

251
00:15:46.066 --> 00:15:48.114
That's why I broke up with you.

252
00:15:51.817 --> 00:15:54.567
Don't worry. I'll be okay.

253
00:15:55.794 --> 00:15:57.776
It's not like you. talking like that.

254
00:15:59.462 --> 00:16:00.795
I'm not saying you should change...

255
00:16:00.820 --> 00:16:01.645
Done eating?

256
00:16:02.130 --> 00:16:04.358
Let's go. your wife is waiting.

257
00:16:05.437 --> 00:16:07.411
There she goes again.

258
00:16:11.137 --> 00:16:12.137
Thank you.

259
00:16:13.958 --> 00:16:15.542
Have a good evening.

260
00:16:17.614 --> 00:16:18.864
Welcome.

261
00:16:18.889 --> 00:16:20.796
Shit. that's so funny. Yeah..

262
00:16:22.524 --> 00:16:23.796
Hey. I'll call you back.

263
00:16:24.303 --> 00:16:26.053
I'm gonna stuff my face.

264
00:16:26.206 --> 00:16:26.812
Yeah.

265
00:16:29.566 --> 00:16:31.316
- Three people?
- Yes. three.

266
00:16:31.603 --> 00:16:35.353
From here to here... we'll take it all.

267
00:16:35.875 --> 00:16:36.390
All of it?

268
00:16:36.860 --> 00:16:38.026
Yeah. all of it.

269
00:16:43.335 --> 00:16:45.000
You're paying today.

270
00:16:46.336 --> 00:16:47.023
Got it?

271
00:16:50.583 --> 00:16:52.500
Damn it. So-eun!

272
00:16:53.359 --> 00:16:55.525
You should answer him. huh?

273
00:16:59.822 --> 00:17:01.988
<i>The entire building
is being locked down.</i>

274
00:17:02.013 --> 00:17:04.679
<i>Security personnel. evacuate
everyone immediately!</i>

275
00:17:05.650 --> 00:17:07.066
What's going on?

276
00:17:10.760 --> 00:17:11.345
Hey!

277
00:17:19.483 --> 00:17:20.316
Everyone evacuate!

278
00:17:20.316 --> 00:17:21.983
Move! Out of the way!

279
00:17:25.233 --> 00:17:28.150
Come out! Everyone move!

280
00:17:37.409 --> 00:17:39.339
Isn't the parking lot that way?

281
00:17:39.650 --> 00:17:40.136
Se-jeong.

282
00:17:42.850 --> 00:17:46.253
You should find at least
one friend you can rely on.

283
00:17:52.100 --> 00:17:53.016
Everyone run!

284
00:17:53.433 --> 00:17:54.433
Run!

285
00:18:14.125 --> 00:18:14.908
Se-jeong!

286
00:18:15.511 --> 00:18:16.594
Damn it...

287
00:18:30.578 --> 00:18:31.328
Hurry!

288
00:18:58.730 --> 00:18:59.730
That way!

289
00:19:09.799 --> 00:19:11.132
Come quick! Hurry!

290
00:19:35.708 --> 00:19:37.958
Hyun-hee. are you hurt?

291
00:19:38.766 --> 00:19:40.516
I'm okay.

292
00:19:42.967 --> 00:19:44.106
What's going on?

293
00:19:45.969 --> 00:19:47.004
It's a terrorist attack.

294
00:19:48.114 --> 00:19:49.364
Who are you?

295
00:19:49.800 --> 00:19:50.966
I'm a policeman.

296
00:19:51.216 --> 00:19:53.216
We got a call that
a bioterrorist attack

297
00:19:53.216 --> 00:19:54.966
would take place in this building.

298
00:19:55.216 --> 00:19:57.883
Those people seem to have
been affected by the attack.

299
00:19:57.883 --> 00:19:59.300
What the hell?

300
00:20:25.883 --> 00:20:26.966
What the fuck?

301
00:20:49.328 --> 00:20:50.411
What the hell is this?

302
00:21:21.466 --> 00:21:23.633
What are those freaks doing?

303
00:21:28.003 --> 00:21:29.987
<i>Turn off the light</i>

304
00:22:12.137 --> 00:22:13.841
What about those students?

305
00:22:13.866 --> 00:22:15.616
Do something. you're a policeman!

306
00:22:15.878 --> 00:22:17.378
We're not safe here. either.

307
00:22:17.403 --> 00:22:19.069
Let's just wait for backup.

308
00:22:19.094 --> 00:22:20.761
So we're going to stand here

309
00:22:20.786 --> 00:22:23.036
and watch as those people get killed?

310
00:22:24.120 --> 00:22:25.203
Hyun-seok...

311
00:22:29.133 --> 00:22:32.716
It looks like they're
going towards that sign.

312
00:22:32.966 --> 00:22:34.550
Huh? The sign?

313
00:22:42.050 --> 00:22:43.550
We can lure them with these.

314
00:22:44.633 --> 00:22:45.550
Those?

315
00:22:46.050 --> 00:22:47.883
What will you do with them?

316
00:22:48.966 --> 00:22:50.716
Use this. my wheelchair!

317
00:22:50.716 --> 00:22:53.466
What are you talking about?

318
00:22:53.466 --> 00:22:55.800
What'll you do without it?

319
00:22:55.883 --> 00:22:57.133
Didn't you see earlier?

320
00:22:57.158 --> 00:23:00.408
If I'm going to get out. I
won't be able to do it on this.

321
00:23:01.732 --> 00:23:04.316
We can't just let those people die.

322
00:23:14.883 --> 00:23:16.383
Fuck!

323
00:23:44.847 --> 00:23:45.763
Hurry!

324
00:23:47.448 --> 00:23:48.448
What?

325
00:23:48.473 --> 00:23:49.973
I can't. There's no way.

326
00:23:52.356 --> 00:23:54.278
Hey. don't go out there!

327
00:24:01.093 --> 00:24:02.093
This way!

328
00:24:02.751 --> 00:24:03.917
Hurry!

329
00:24:14.335 --> 00:24:15.585
Shut up. will you?

330
00:24:15.610 --> 00:24:16.443
Hurry!

331
00:24:33.456 --> 00:24:34.706
I'll go get her.

332
00:24:47.573 --> 00:24:49.073
Come. let's go.

333
00:24:49.660 --> 00:24:50.722
Come with me.

334
00:24:50.747 --> 00:24:52.221
You can do it. Let's go.

335
00:24:52.451 --> 00:24:55.252
Take my hand and go.

336
00:24:55.277 --> 00:24:57.083
Let's go. hurry.

337
00:25:03.106 --> 00:25:04.023
Kyu-seong!

338
00:25:15.800 --> 00:25:17.800
Come here. asshole!

339
00:25:20.640 --> 00:25:22.173
Get in. hurry!

340
00:26:19.883 --> 00:26:21.800
<i>If I say our company's main business</i>

341
00:26:21.800 --> 00:26:23.383
<i>is collective intelligence...</i>

342
00:26:23.466 --> 00:26:24.883
<i>"Why is a bio company.</i>

343
00:26:24.883 --> 00:26:27.966
<i>rather than an IT company.
studying that topic?"</i>

344
00:26:28.466 --> 00:26:30.133
<i>These fellows upgrade themselves</i>

345
00:26:30.133 --> 00:26:31.716
<i>through information exchange.</i>

346
00:26:35.286 --> 00:26:38.429
<i>Collective intelligence is a
key force driving evolution.</i>

347
00:27:18.721 --> 00:27:19.682
Kyu-seong!

348
00:27:20.632 --> 00:27:21.715
Hurry!

349
00:27:23.633 --> 00:27:24.633
No!

350
00:27:55.739 --> 00:27:59.717
<i>My Better Half</i>

351
00:28:05.659 --> 00:28:08.242
<i>This afternoon. the Doongwoori Building</i>

352
00:28:08.267 --> 00:28:11.850
<i>was locked down following
an act of bio-terrorism.</i>

353
00:28:12.216 --> 00:28:15.466
<i>Health authorities designated
the location a terrorism zone.</i>

354
00:28:15.550 --> 00:28:18.216
<i>and a full quarantine is in
effect until an investigation..</i>

355
00:28:18.216 --> 00:28:19.800
<i>The Counterterrorism HQ says</i>

356
00:28:19.800 --> 00:28:22.300
<i>the virus in question
is highly contagious</i>

357
00:28:22.466 --> 00:28:24.466
<i>and spreads extremely quickly.</i>

358
00:28:24.466 --> 00:28:27.133
<i>The Disease Control Agency
is devoting all its resources</i>

359
00:28:27.133 --> 00:28:28.216
<i>to obtaining</i>

360
00:28:28.216 --> 00:28:29.466
<i>and researching possible vaccines.</i>

361
00:28:29.550 --> 00:28:30.883
<i>Meanwhile. unconfirmed rumors</i>

362
00:28:30.883 --> 00:28:32.300
<i>about this bio-terrorism attack</i>

363
00:28:32.300 --> 00:28:35.183
<i>are rapidly spreading online.</i>

364
00:28:35.466 --> 00:28:36.966
SWAT deployment complete.

365
00:28:37.108 --> 00:28:38.691
Double barricade of
Doongwoori Building in place.

366
00:28:39.191 --> 00:28:40.167
Visual confirmation.

367
00:28:54.466 --> 00:28:56.216
<i>Hello. shoppers.</i>

368
00:28:56.979 --> 00:29:00.812
<i>Thank you for visiting Doongwoori
Shopping Mall today.</i>

369
00:29:01.591 --> 00:29:04.591
<i>The shopping mall is now closing.</i>

370
00:29:05.434 --> 00:29:08.191
<i>We look forward to
welcoming you tomorrow</i>

371
00:29:08.450 --> 00:29:10.576
<i>with even better service.</i>

372
00:29:11.583 --> 00:29:15.309
<i>We wish you a comfortable
and safe trip home.</i>

373
00:29:15.919 --> 00:29:16.525
<i>Thank you.</i>

374
00:29:16.550 --> 00:29:18.550
Shit. the data's not working.

375
00:29:19.050 --> 00:29:20.633
I'm okay. Yeah.

376
00:29:21.883 --> 00:29:23.133
And you. Dad?

377
00:29:24.216 --> 00:29:26.050
<i>My Dearest Daughter</i>

378
00:29:26.716 --> 00:29:28.300
Really? Thank God.

379
00:29:34.184 --> 00:29:34.973
<i>Dad!</i>

380
00:29:36.630 --> 00:29:38.964
<i>- Who are you? Where's my dad?
- Did Dad answer?</i>

381
00:29:40.133 --> 00:29:41.633
<i>Ji-hye. go to Grandma for a sec.</i>

382
00:29:42.050 --> 00:29:43.633
<i>- Why?
- Just for a sec.</i>

383
00:29:43.716 --> 00:29:44.800
<i>Mom. take her.</i>

384
00:29:44.800 --> 00:29:46.800
<i>Right. come with me for a minute.</i>

385
00:29:53.437 --> 00:29:54.520
<i>What...</i>

386
00:29:57.159 --> 00:29:58.825
<i>What about Kyu-seong?</i>

387
00:30:02.466 --> 00:30:04.133
<i>Did he go somewhere?</i>

388
00:30:06.466 --> 00:30:07.800
Kyu-seong...

389
00:30:09.300 --> 00:30:12.300
saved some people. and then...

390
00:30:13.358 --> 00:30:14.525
<i>Who...</i>

391
00:30:14.781 --> 00:30:16.281
<i>Who did he save?</i>

392
00:30:17.070 --> 00:30:18.903
Everything just sucks!

393
00:30:18.928 --> 00:30:20.261
<i>And then what?</i>

394
00:30:20.966 --> 00:30:23.633
<i>And then what happened?</i>

395
00:30:31.051 --> 00:30:32.801
- Kyu-seong...
- Dad!

396
00:30:41.133 --> 00:30:42.466
What are you talking about?

397
00:30:43.050 --> 00:30:45.466
You know how long I've been stuck here?

398
00:30:47.550 --> 00:30:50.216
You won't get infected
unless you're bitten!

399
00:30:51.300 --> 00:30:52.466
What did you say?

400
00:30:54.133 --> 00:30:55.050
Here.

401
00:30:55.883 --> 00:30:56.883
What's this?

402
00:30:57.216 --> 00:30:58.550
What do you think?

403
00:31:01.216 --> 00:31:02.633
You're going to carry me?

404
00:31:02.800 --> 00:31:04.383
Who else is going to carry you?

405
00:31:05.133 --> 00:31:06.966
Think of it as going camping.

406
00:31:07.300 --> 00:31:11.883
This is why you should think
twice before helping others.

407
00:31:14.800 --> 00:31:16.300
Listen. Officer!

408
00:31:16.383 --> 00:31:18.800
There's a rescue team
coming to get us. right?

409
00:31:20.966 --> 00:31:21.966
The rescue team

410
00:31:23.716 --> 00:31:24.883
can't come in here.

411
00:31:25.050 --> 00:31:25.800
What?

412
00:31:26.221 --> 00:31:27.721
What are you saying?

413
00:31:27.746 --> 00:31:29.329
We're all still alive!

414
00:31:29.408 --> 00:31:31.741
The news has reported that this virus

415
00:31:31.766 --> 00:31:33.516
is unbelievably contagious.

416
00:31:33.552 --> 00:31:35.719
Until an epidemiological
analysis is done.

417
00:31:35.786 --> 00:31:37.620
this building is under quarantine.

418
00:31:37.645 --> 00:31:38.978
Then what about us?

419
00:31:39.003 --> 00:31:41.337
They're telling us to just die here?

420
00:31:41.362 --> 00:31:42.779
I don't wanna die...

421
00:31:42.804 --> 00:31:44.887
- I don't wanna die!
- I'm going fucking crazy...

422
00:31:44.912 --> 00:31:47.579
Fuck. you know how much
I pay this country in taxes?

423
00:31:47.604 --> 00:31:49.937
But they won't save me?

424
00:31:50.914 --> 00:31:54.914
There is one way that we can be saved.

425
00:31:55.324 --> 00:31:56.508
What's that?

426
00:31:56.659 --> 00:31:59.492
The man behind this
attack. Suh Young-chul.

427
00:31:59.517 --> 00:32:01.933
says he's injected the
vaccine into his own body.

428
00:32:02.037 --> 00:32:05.037
If we find him and bring him
out. we can all be rescued.

429
00:32:05.062 --> 00:32:06.479
Where is he?

430
00:32:07.323 --> 00:32:10.656
It's said he attended the
seminar in this building today.

431
00:32:10.806 --> 00:32:12.437
and there's no sign that he left.

432
00:32:13.979 --> 00:32:15.039
Suh Young-chul...

433
00:32:15.964 --> 00:32:18.630
came to meet Chains Bio
CEO Kang Woo-cheol.

434
00:32:19.175 --> 00:32:20.091
That's right.

435
00:32:20.265 --> 00:32:21.015
How'd you know that?

436
00:32:21.040 --> 00:32:22.290
After the seminar.

437
00:32:22.633 --> 00:32:25.258
I saw him by Kang's VIP
Room on the 3rd floor.

438
00:32:25.606 --> 00:32:27.773
You must be a professor.

439
00:32:28.026 --> 00:32:29.692
Then where did he go?

440
00:32:29.717 --> 00:32:33.051
I saw him follow Kang into the room.

441
00:32:33.076 --> 00:32:34.743
So what are we supposed to do?

442
00:32:35.082 --> 00:32:36.832
We can't even set
foot outside this door!

443
00:32:36.857 --> 00:32:40.258
Go up to the 3rd floor?
How can we make it there?

444
00:32:40.283 --> 00:32:41.450
Right...

445
00:32:42.152 --> 00:32:43.568
Those people out there

446
00:32:43.678 --> 00:32:46.511
<i>seem to be evolving through
information exchange.</i>

447
00:32:47.307 --> 00:32:49.140
<i>First they walked on all fours.</i>

448
00:32:49.165 --> 00:32:50.915
<i>and charged at signs.</i>

449
00:32:51.708 --> 00:32:53.125
<i>Now they walk on two feet</i>

450
00:32:53.542 --> 00:32:55.250
<i>and their ability to identify humans</i>

451
00:32:55.664 --> 00:32:57.164
is slowly taking shape.

452
00:32:58.133 --> 00:32:59.883
They're exchanging info?

453
00:33:00.175 --> 00:33:02.425
How. by calling each other?

454
00:33:02.828 --> 00:33:04.995
Words are not the only
way to communicate.

455
00:33:05.246 --> 00:33:06.496
Like fungi or mushrooms.

456
00:33:06.692 --> 00:33:08.025
many creatures other than humans

457
00:33:08.050 --> 00:33:09.716
have their own communication networks.

458
00:33:09.716 --> 00:33:13.466
For example. ants
communicate by pheromones.

459
00:33:14.109 --> 00:33:16.275
And to expedite the
exchange of pheromones.

460
00:33:16.300 --> 00:33:18.466
they create a communication
network of mucus.

461
00:33:18.726 --> 00:33:22.309
So you're saying the
infected people there.

462
00:33:22.691 --> 00:33:24.691
they're in a state resembling ants?

463
00:33:24.716 --> 00:33:26.883
If they have collective
intelligence based

464
00:33:26.883 --> 00:33:28.216
on information exchange.

465
00:33:28.466 --> 00:33:31.050
perhaps we can input false information.

466
00:33:32.800 --> 00:33:34.966
What. they've turned into ants?

467
00:33:35.133 --> 00:33:38.216
So how do we give them false info?

468
00:33:38.716 --> 00:33:40.133
Show them fake news?

469
00:33:40.216 --> 00:33:42.466
Ants. too. often show errant behavior

470
00:33:42.466 --> 00:33:44.550
when receiving false information.

471
00:33:44.633 --> 00:33:47.216
For example. ant mills.

472
00:33:47.966 --> 00:33:49.800
Sometimes while exchanging pheromones.

473
00:33:49.966 --> 00:33:51.633
an error occurs.

474
00:33:51.716 --> 00:33:55.050
At such times. they form
a giant circle in one spot

475
00:33:55.050 --> 00:33:58.216
and keep turning in
place. unable to stop.

476
00:33:59.133 --> 00:34:00.466
Until they die.

477
00:34:00.800 --> 00:34:04.050
So how are we going to
give them false information?

478
00:34:04.383 --> 00:34:08.383
If one of us went to them
giving off a special odor.

479
00:34:08.633 --> 00:34:10.466
and the rest of us stood still.

480
00:34:10.466 --> 00:34:12.800
giving off a completely different odor.

481
00:34:12.966 --> 00:34:15.550
I don't think they'd be able
to recognize us as humans.

482
00:34:16.133 --> 00:34:18.550
Then until they figure
out their mistake.

483
00:34:18.966 --> 00:34:20.883
we can buy ourselves some time.

484
00:34:22.181 --> 00:34:24.181
Who's gonna do that?

485
00:34:24.206 --> 00:34:25.289
I'll do it.

486
00:34:26.323 --> 00:34:28.073
You'll fail. 100%.

487
00:34:28.453 --> 00:34:31.703
Look. how about someone more fit?

488
00:34:32.479 --> 00:34:33.716
This guy should do.

489
00:34:34.073 --> 00:34:34.941
I'll do it.

490
00:34:35.192 --> 00:34:36.760
I said I'll do it.

491
00:34:37.856 --> 00:34:39.760
You're looking down on
me because of my age.

492
00:34:40.339 --> 00:34:41.608
But in my 20s. I won a gold medal

493
00:34:41.633 --> 00:34:43.550
in a national track
and field competition.

494
00:34:43.550 --> 00:34:44.966
Yeah sure. you stay out.

495
00:34:46.300 --> 00:34:47.300
That hurts! Ouch!

496
00:34:50.133 --> 00:34:52.216
I coached track and
field before retiring.

497
00:34:52.550 --> 00:34:55.883
Professor. tell me what I should do.

498
00:35:04.966 --> 00:35:06.633
Where should I put this?

499
00:35:06.633 --> 00:35:07.800
Here.

500
00:35:08.050 --> 00:35:09.383
- Here?
- Yeah.

501
00:35:09.383 --> 00:35:11.966
I added you all to a
group chat. so check it.

502
00:35:12.633 --> 00:35:16.300
If they're exchanging information.
we should do it. too.

503
00:35:33.216 --> 00:35:35.633
Bring back this same perfume.

504
00:35:45.800 --> 00:35:48.300
Hey. you nutjobs!

505
00:35:48.883 --> 00:35:50.133
Come and get me!

506
00:37:14.133 --> 00:37:15.216
Hurry!

507
00:37:15.550 --> 00:37:17.216
Close the door!

508
00:37:18.800 --> 00:37:20.466
I got them. Here.

509
00:37:32.966 --> 00:37:34.133
That antifreeze. bring it here!

510
00:37:34.133 --> 00:37:35.300
Antifreeze. okay!

511
00:37:39.966 --> 00:37:40.800
Here.

512
00:37:40.800 --> 00:37:41.800
That stinks!

513
00:37:41.966 --> 00:37:43.800
Why does this smell so strong?

514
00:38:03.883 --> 00:38:05.216
- Ready?
- Yeah.

515
00:40:15.800 --> 00:40:17.383
We can go now.

516
00:40:36.883 --> 00:40:37.716
Hurry up!

517
00:40:39.716 --> 00:40:40.966
Let's just go!

518
00:40:44.716 --> 00:40:45.800
What are you doing?

519
00:40:48.383 --> 00:40:50.216
Does anyone have a lighter?

520
00:41:20.656 --> 00:41:21.656
Hurry. run!

521
00:41:23.116 --> 00:41:24.283
Behind us!

522
00:41:45.633 --> 00:41:46.716
Run. quickly!

523
00:41:51.800 --> 00:41:52.800
Hold on tight.

524
00:42:13.070 --> 00:42:13.987
Look out!

525
00:42:52.550 --> 00:42:54.800
<i>How did a world-renowned scientist</i>

526
00:42:54.800 --> 00:42:57.633
<i>become a terrorist
threatening the nation?</i>

527
00:42:57.800 --> 00:43:00.883
<i>Let's look into the background
of Dr. Suh Young-chul.</i>

528
00:43:00.966 --> 00:43:02.800
<i>He was top-ranked at his university</i>

529
00:43:02.800 --> 00:43:04.383
<i>from entrance to graduation.</i>

530
00:43:04.633 --> 00:43:07.966
<i>and his graduation thesis
"Biocomputing With Fungi"</i>

531
00:43:08.133 --> 00:43:10.800
<i>was published in the journal Science.</i>

532
00:43:11.328 --> 00:43:12.961
<i>For such a promising talent</i>

533
00:43:13.250 --> 00:43:14.578
<i>to suddenly commit terrorism</i>

534
00:43:14.603 --> 00:43:15.966
<i>and hold the nation hostage.</i>

535
00:43:16.050 --> 00:43:17.800
<i>it's quite hard to understand.</i>

536
00:43:17.800 --> 00:43:18.716
<i>Reporter Kim Seong-il.</i>

537
00:43:18.883 --> 00:43:20.883
<i>are there any other notable details</i>

538
00:43:20.883 --> 00:43:22.466
<i>concerning Suh Young-chul?</i>

539
00:43:22.466 --> 00:43:26.300
<i>Suh's father was a
Professor of Applied Biology</i>

540
00:43:26.325 --> 00:43:28.011
<i>at Seocheong University.</i>

541
00:43:28.709 --> 00:43:28.877
<i>Prof. Suh Denies
Misuse of Research Funds</i>

542
00:43:28.902 --> 00:43:29.917
<i>While he was there.</i>

543
00:43:29.942 --> 00:43:32.586
<i>an anonymous tip led
to an internal report</i>

544
00:43:32.611 --> 00:43:34.830
<i>on misuse of funds for his research lab</i>

545
00:43:34.855 --> 00:43:37.047
<i>and exploitation of
student researchers.</i>

546
00:43:37.072 --> 00:43:38.985
<i>and this was widely
covered in the press.</i>

547
00:43:39.010 --> 00:43:41.166
<i>Four weeks after the report.</i>

548
00:43:41.191 --> 00:43:44.025
<i>Professor Suh chose
to end his own life.</i>

549
00:43:44.050 --> 00:43:46.300
<i>Is there any link between this incident</i>

550
00:43:46.300 --> 00:43:48.550
<i>and Suh Young-chul's terrorist attack?</i>

551
00:43:48.575 --> 00:43:51.742
<i>Could it be some sort of revenge?</i>

552
00:43:52.064 --> 00:43:55.564
<i>So far. Suh has not made
any requests or demands.</i>

553
00:43:55.589 --> 00:43:59.525
<i>so it seems unlikely that
the two incidents are related.</i>

554
00:43:59.550 --> 00:44:02.133
<i>At the moment. the
government has not released</i>

555
00:44:02.133 --> 00:44:04.133
<i>any information about the attack.</i>

556
00:44:05.218 --> 00:44:06.385
<i>3rd Floor.</i>

557
00:44:16.848 --> 00:44:17.691
No one here.

558
00:44:17.716 --> 00:44:18.633
Hurry!

559
00:44:48.034 --> 00:44:49.441
Suh Young-chul. you are under arrest

560
00:44:49.466 --> 00:44:51.633
for the Doongwoori
Building terrorist attack.

561
00:44:51.966 --> 00:44:54.550
You have the right to an attorney.

562
00:44:54.633 --> 00:44:56.466
and the right to remain silent.

563
00:44:56.633 --> 00:44:59.633
Anything you say can and will
be used against you in court...

564
00:44:59.633 --> 00:45:00.883
Nice to meet you.

565
00:45:01.216 --> 00:45:04.300
Using water to disrupt their
communications network.

566
00:45:04.883 --> 00:45:06.800
that was your idea. Professor Kwon?

567
00:45:07.216 --> 00:45:07.966
What's this?

568
00:45:07.966 --> 00:45:09.383
You two know each other?

569
00:45:09.383 --> 00:45:10.716
But that was a mistake.

570
00:45:13.216 --> 00:45:15.383
Water evaporates quickly.

571
00:45:15.383 --> 00:45:18.216
If water mixes in the
air with their network.

572
00:45:18.216 --> 00:45:19.633
won't it work faster?

573
00:45:20.300 --> 00:45:21.216
Forget it.

574
00:45:21.703 --> 00:45:22.870
What now?

575
00:45:23.315 --> 00:45:24.565
Is the rescue team coming?

576
00:45:25.153 --> 00:45:25.792
No.

577
00:45:26.489 --> 00:45:28.393
We have to meet the
rescue team on the roof.

578
00:45:28.629 --> 00:45:29.129
What?

579
00:45:29.154 --> 00:45:31.128
The rescue team must not
be exposed to the infected.

580
00:45:31.153 --> 00:45:35.070
We almost died coming here.
now we have to go to the roof?

581
00:45:35.218 --> 00:45:38.301
Can't the rescue team come
down and wipe them all out?

582
00:45:38.883 --> 00:45:40.466
Those people are patients.

583
00:45:40.800 --> 00:45:43.050
We've been ordered not
to kill them without reason.

584
00:45:43.050 --> 00:45:44.716
What bullshit!

585
00:45:44.716 --> 00:45:46.466
Those monsters out there are patients?

586
00:45:46.883 --> 00:45:48.550
Do patients kill people?

587
00:45:49.716 --> 00:45:52.633
Damn it. I don't care if they're
monsters or whatever.

588
00:45:52.658 --> 00:45:55.741
At any rate. if we can
get him up to the roof.

589
00:45:55.766 --> 00:45:58.515
the rescue team will come.
Then we can all survive.

590
00:45:58.954 --> 00:46:01.620
We just need to find a
safe way to get there.

591
00:46:02.716 --> 00:46:03.812
Is there one?

592
00:46:04.261 --> 00:46:05.086
There is.

593
00:46:05.369 --> 00:46:09.203
There's a cargo elevator that
most people don't know about.

594
00:46:10.718 --> 00:46:12.172
That seems safest.

595
00:46:13.383 --> 00:46:15.550
I think that security guard's right.

596
00:46:18.550 --> 00:46:21.300
Alright. let's give it a try.

597
00:46:21.716 --> 00:46:23.466
You take the lead.

598
00:46:27.276 --> 00:46:28.609
Let's go.

599
00:46:30.487 --> 00:46:31.244
You first.

600
00:46:36.419 --> 00:46:37.586
Professor Gong!

601
00:46:41.645 --> 00:46:44.300
You got here quickly.

602
00:46:44.466 --> 00:46:45.300
Yes.

603
00:46:46.551 --> 00:46:48.468
This was Suh Young-chul's research lab?

604
00:46:48.633 --> 00:46:49.383
Yeah.

605
00:46:49.466 --> 00:46:54.466
After leaving Chains Bio. it
seems he kept researching here.

606
00:46:54.800 --> 00:46:55.800
Professor Joo!

607
00:46:56.050 --> 00:46:56.716
Yeah.

608
00:46:57.466 --> 00:47:00.550
Say hello. This is Myunghan
University Biotechnology.

609
00:47:00.550 --> 00:47:01.966
Professor Gong Sul-hee.

610
00:47:02.883 --> 00:47:05.466
These are professors Lee
Hyeon-myeong and Jo Hyeon-mi.

611
00:47:05.466 --> 00:47:07.466
So the government has assembled

612
00:47:07.466 --> 00:47:09.550
this special investigative team.

613
00:47:09.550 --> 00:47:11.966
When the SWAT team
goes in. we'll join them.

614
00:47:12.205 --> 00:47:13.872
so prepare yourself. Professor Gong.

615
00:47:14.300 --> 00:47:15.550
Understood.

616
00:47:15.800 --> 00:47:17.466
<i>Alpha Team take the front door.</i>

617
00:47:17.466 --> 00:47:19.216
<i>Delta Team enter from the back.</i>

618
00:47:36.609 --> 00:47:37.776
Shit...

619
00:47:38.515 --> 00:47:39.633
I'm gonna do it.

620
00:47:40.105 --> 00:47:41.164
I'm pushing it.

621
00:47:51.403 --> 00:47:54.070
Hurry up!

622
00:47:54.249 --> 00:47:55.082
Hurry!

623
00:47:56.466 --> 00:47:57.966
Close the door. quick!

624
00:48:03.550 --> 00:48:04.966
<i>Going up.</i>

625
00:48:07.300 --> 00:48:09.800
<i>We'll be on the roof in 5 minutes.</i>

626
00:48:13.133 --> 00:48:14.633
How old are you?

627
00:48:15.351 --> 00:48:17.268
You're in great shape for your age.

628
00:48:18.427 --> 00:48:20.344
The way you slid back
there was so cool.

629
00:48:21.312 --> 00:48:22.729
You were so fast.

630
00:48:23.488 --> 00:48:24.148
Like this.

631
00:48:27.550 --> 00:48:28.633
<i>The doors are opening.</i>

632
00:48:46.284 --> 00:48:47.117
No!

633
00:49:11.531 --> 00:49:12.948
He got away!

634
00:49:14.341 --> 00:49:15.925
Who cares if he did?

635
00:49:16.471 --> 00:49:19.637
You really think that bastard's
more important than us?

636
00:49:19.716 --> 00:49:21.466
That jerk is the vaccine.

637
00:49:21.716 --> 00:49:24.966
You saw it now. The infected
didn't even touch him.

638
00:49:25.133 --> 00:49:27.050
We need to take that
vaccine out with us!

639
00:49:27.216 --> 00:49:28.383
But...

640
00:49:28.966 --> 00:49:30.966
How are we supposed to bring him out?

641
00:49:30.966 --> 00:49:34.633
You saw how those monsters
are swarming all over!

642
00:49:35.216 --> 00:49:37.716
How do we pull him out of there?

643
00:49:38.633 --> 00:49:39.800
<i>The doors are opening.</i>

644
00:49:49.633 --> 00:49:53.300
What? Are those bastards mimicking us?

645
00:49:58.800 --> 00:50:00.466
<i>The doors are closing.</i>

646
00:50:04.114 --> 00:50:05.698
What do we do now?

647
00:50:06.473 --> 00:50:07.608
- Hyun-seok.
- Yeah?

648
00:50:07.633 --> 00:50:09.133
Is there a control room where

649
00:50:09.216 --> 00:50:11.133
you can see all the building's CCTVs?

650
00:50:11.133 --> 00:50:12.466
What? A control room?

651
00:50:12.800 --> 00:50:14.800
You should know. you're
on the security team.

652
00:50:15.133 --> 00:50:15.383
Yeah.

653
00:50:15.383 --> 00:50:18.466
If we can watch all of the CCTVs.

654
00:50:18.550 --> 00:50:21.633
we can see where he's
going in real time.

655
00:50:22.133 --> 00:50:23.633
The control room...

656
00:50:24.716 --> 00:50:26.633
is at the very end of Floor B2.

657
00:50:26.633 --> 00:50:28.300
B2! B2!

658
00:50:28.300 --> 00:50:31.216
For now. let's go
there and look for Suh.

659
00:50:43.133 --> 00:50:44.383
Alpha. clear.

660
00:50:45.300 --> 00:50:46.633
Delta. clear.

661
00:50:47.383 --> 00:50:49.716
He's set up an entire lab here.

662
00:51:02.966 --> 00:51:04.800
You should see this over here.

663
00:51:20.550 --> 00:51:23.383
What is this? Are they all dead?

664
00:51:24.133 --> 00:51:25.383
They're alive.

665
00:51:32.050 --> 00:51:34.050
What experiment was he doing?

666
00:51:41.883 --> 00:51:44.133
Here! This one's been opened!

667
00:51:46.966 --> 00:51:48.050
Contact!

668
00:52:39.716 --> 00:52:40.883
Attack!

669
00:52:42.333 --> 00:52:43.500
Return fire!

670
00:52:44.284 --> 00:52:45.200
Alpha down!

671
00:52:53.714 --> 00:52:54.964
Contact!

672
00:52:56.552 --> 00:52:58.469
Take her to safety!

673
00:53:37.050 --> 00:53:39.716
Targets have stopped
moving. Clear. confirming.

674
00:53:40.151 --> 00:53:41.567
Clear. confirming.

675
00:53:45.966 --> 00:53:47.300
They've all stopped.

676
00:53:48.050 --> 00:53:49.466
Each defend your own zone.

677
00:53:49.466 --> 00:53:51.716
In case of danger. respond immediately.

678
00:54:38.633 --> 00:54:39.633
What's that?

679
00:54:40.466 --> 00:54:41.966
That's evolving?

680
00:54:43.216 --> 00:54:44.883
Where's the control room?

681
00:54:45.383 --> 00:54:46.466
That way.

682
00:54:46.466 --> 00:54:48.216
Okay. let's move quietly.

683
00:55:55.239 --> 00:55:56.823
Pull yourself together!

684
00:56:17.216 --> 00:56:18.466
Sit me down here.

685
00:56:18.716 --> 00:56:20.133
Close that.

686
00:56:26.383 --> 00:56:28.716
These are the main cameras.

687
00:56:29.300 --> 00:56:30.800
And for the auxiliary cams..

688
00:56:30.800 --> 00:56:31.716
CCTV.

689
00:56:33.883 --> 00:56:35.966
What floor did Suh get off on?

690
00:56:36.300 --> 00:56:37.300
8th floor?

691
00:56:37.633 --> 00:56:39.800
The 9th floor. I'll
start looking there.

692
00:56:46.677 --> 00:56:48.844
<i>You're in great shape for your age.</i>

693
00:56:49.450 --> 00:56:51.441
<i>The way you slid
back there was so cool.</i>

694
00:56:51.692 --> 00:56:52.950
<i>You were so fast.</i>

695
00:56:53.586 --> 00:56:55.586
How could Suh have known?

696
00:56:56.800 --> 00:56:58.383
The things he said in the elevator.

697
00:56:58.550 --> 00:57:00.550
as if he'd watched what we'd done.

698
00:57:02.698 --> 00:57:03.698
You're right.

699
00:57:04.716 --> 00:57:06.966
Is he watching CCTVs like us?

700
00:57:08.856 --> 00:57:12.856
If Suh can see through
the eyes of the infected...

701
00:57:14.144 --> 00:57:14.894
Hold on. then...

702
00:57:16.252 --> 00:57:18.168
Whatever these monsters see.

703
00:57:18.856 --> 00:57:20.606
Suh can see the same thing?

704
00:57:20.778 --> 00:57:22.695
He sees the same thing? What the hell?

705
00:57:22.848 --> 00:57:23.848
I found him!

706
00:57:28.223 --> 00:57:29.223
Here.

707
00:57:29.716 --> 00:57:31.633
Where's that bastard going?

708
00:57:56.031 --> 00:57:57.198
What's he doing?

709
00:58:01.828 --> 00:58:03.328
Where is he going?

710
00:58:05.550 --> 00:58:07.216
It seems he's searching for something.

711
00:58:07.716 --> 00:58:09.050
He stopped.

712
00:58:09.289 --> 00:58:10.195
Where is that?

713
00:58:10.851 --> 00:58:12.414
3rd Floor. Building A Hallway.

714
00:58:12.439 --> 00:58:14.478
3rd Floor. Building A Hallway...

715
00:58:16.760 --> 00:58:17.406
Bro!

716
00:58:19.800 --> 00:58:22.633
You locked me up. so I had
a hard time finding you.

717
00:58:28.716 --> 00:58:29.966
Oh. that's...

718
00:58:30.133 --> 00:58:31.966
CEO Kang Woo-cheol.

719
00:58:31.966 --> 00:58:32.966
Huh?

720
00:58:33.050 --> 00:58:35.216
The first person Suh met.

721
00:58:36.883 --> 00:58:40.050
He was probably the first infected.

722
00:58:46.800 --> 00:58:49.133
See. wasn't I right?

723
00:58:51.800 --> 00:58:54.604
I said you'd be my link
to the new humanity.

724
00:58:55.286 --> 00:58:56.870
So hurry up and bite me.

725
00:59:08.133 --> 00:59:09.966
Wait. did he just bite him?

726
00:59:10.614 --> 00:59:11.448
What's happening to him?

727
00:59:26.466 --> 00:59:27.466
Look at them.

728
00:59:45.539 --> 00:59:47.206
I'm not sure what it is.

729
00:59:47.906 --> 00:59:49.133
but they must be receiving some

730
00:59:49.133 --> 00:59:50.966
completely new sort of information.

731
00:59:52.883 --> 00:59:56.716
What is it? Is it connected
to Suh being bitten?

732
00:59:57.386 --> 00:59:59.136
I have no idea.

733
00:59:59.987 --> 01:00:02.987
Then how long will they
be in this condition?

734
01:00:03.385 --> 01:00:04.550
Before. they were like
that for several minutes.

735
01:00:04.550 --> 01:00:06.300
There's no way to know.

736
01:00:08.714 --> 01:00:10.423
Okay. this is our chance.

737
01:00:10.448 --> 01:00:13.307
While they're in that state.
we should go get the vaccine.

738
01:00:13.768 --> 01:00:15.934
He's on the 3rd floor.
it won't take long.

739
01:00:17.885 --> 01:00:20.468
I'll watch the CCTV from here

740
01:00:20.608 --> 01:00:23.108
and tell you where it's safe.
through the group chat.

741
01:00:23.414 --> 01:00:25.831
What. you?

742
01:00:28.028 --> 01:00:29.028
You're going to stay here?

743
01:00:29.053 --> 01:00:30.637
Get the vaccine and come back.

744
01:00:30.769 --> 01:00:32.935
Until then. I'll tell you where to go.

745
01:00:33.216 --> 01:00:35.216
How can I leave you behind?

746
01:00:35.716 --> 01:00:38.800
Listen to me. This is the safest way.

747
01:00:39.909 --> 01:00:41.025
Yes. let's do that.

748
01:00:41.198 --> 01:00:44.031
We don't know when they'll
wake up. so let's hurry.

749
01:01:35.110 --> 01:01:37.610
Let's drag him to someplace safe.

750
01:01:43.975 --> 01:01:46.366
What's going on?

751
01:01:52.856 --> 01:01:53.856
Go. quick!

752
01:01:55.215 --> 01:01:56.715
Hurry! Run!

753
01:02:01.622 --> 01:02:02.895
Hurry! Get inside!

754
01:02:04.466 --> 01:02:05.466
Hurry!

755
01:02:09.895 --> 01:02:11.300
What is this freak doing?

756
01:02:14.746 --> 01:02:16.333
They're leaving.

757
01:02:47.050 --> 01:02:48.383
Go that way.

758
01:02:55.062 --> 01:02:56.062
This way. quickly!

759
01:03:17.816 --> 01:03:19.149
They're gone.

760
01:03:20.300 --> 01:03:22.050
What the hell did you do?

761
01:03:25.633 --> 01:03:29.070
Ah. did you only pretend
to go out? You're smart.

762
01:03:30.065 --> 01:03:31.468
You think if you cover my eyes.

763
01:03:31.747 --> 01:03:34.247
you'll be able to get
out of here alive?

764
01:03:34.393 --> 01:03:35.893
What's this freak yammering about?

765
01:03:36.773 --> 01:03:38.539
Since getting bitten by Kang Woo-cheol.

766
01:03:38.786 --> 01:03:40.870
it seems he can communicate
with all of them.

767
01:03:41.216 --> 01:03:42.466
Wait. then...

768
01:03:42.883 --> 01:03:47.050
that means he can control
all those monsters out there.

769
01:03:48.383 --> 01:03:50.550
Let's only communicate by texting.

770
01:03:50.633 --> 01:03:52.800
Don't let him see or hear anything.

771
01:04:06.742 --> 01:04:09.825
But didn't we file all
of our reports already?

772
01:04:09.850 --> 01:04:12.183
Why are they calling us to
the Counterterrorism HQ?

773
01:04:12.560 --> 01:04:14.282
We'll see when we get there.

774
01:04:39.558 --> 01:04:41.641
<i>From office go straight
to emergency exit.</i>

775
01:04:41.666 --> 01:04:43.260
<i>Up stairs to 4th floor.
to machine room.</i>

776
01:04:47.448 --> 01:04:48.104
Let's hurry.

777
01:05:11.799 --> 01:05:12.965
Wait a minute.

778
01:05:15.215 --> 01:05:18.002
We're going back to where we started.

779
01:05:19.343 --> 01:05:20.593
That's right. Why?

780
01:05:21.472 --> 01:05:22.889
We need to pick up my sister.

781
01:05:22.914 --> 01:05:26.164
But now we can get
out with the vaccine.

782
01:05:26.431 --> 01:05:27.597
Oh. that's right.

783
01:05:27.909 --> 01:05:29.767
This way. there's an
elevator to the roof.

784
01:05:30.799 --> 01:05:32.465
What's going on?

785
01:05:33.088 --> 01:05:34.878
What are you suggesting here?

786
01:05:34.991 --> 01:05:37.241
But now we just need to go up.

787
01:05:37.266 --> 01:05:39.016
You expect us to go
back to the control room?

788
01:06:15.132 --> 01:06:17.882
<i>Control Room</i>

789
01:06:32.815 --> 01:06:33.619
What the hell?

790
01:06:33.806 --> 01:06:34.477
Hey!

791
01:06:34.502 --> 01:06:36.585
What do you think you're doing?

792
01:06:37.355 --> 01:06:38.220
- You...
- What?

793
01:06:38.245 --> 01:06:39.240
What did you do?

794
01:06:39.374 --> 01:06:40.458
Stop it.

795
01:06:40.483 --> 01:06:42.233
Make it fucking stop!

796
01:06:44.121 --> 01:06:45.447
I can't let this bastard go.

797
01:06:45.646 --> 01:06:48.730
I'm taking him with me. You. follow me!

798
01:06:49.382 --> 01:06:50.465
Come on!

799
01:06:50.715 --> 01:06:52.132
What are you doing?

800
01:06:52.299 --> 01:06:53.632
Are you crazy?

801
01:06:54.299 --> 01:06:55.965
Don't touch that vaccine!

802
01:06:59.382 --> 01:07:02.715
I'm sorry. but give up on your sister.

803
01:07:03.382 --> 01:07:04.215
It's too late.

804
01:07:35.056 --> 01:07:37.627
<i>Hyun-seok</i>

805
01:07:40.905 --> 01:07:42.585
Until he brings back his sister.

806
01:07:42.610 --> 01:07:44.027
we're going to wait here.

807
01:07:44.052 --> 01:07:44.874
Got it?

808
01:07:59.363 --> 01:08:00.863
Everyone listen up.

809
01:08:00.960 --> 01:08:04.460
This vaccine here is more
important than anyone.

810
01:08:04.839 --> 01:08:06.832
This is for the whole world. okay?

811
01:08:12.001 --> 01:08:15.501
If you want to live. lead the way.

812
01:08:16.515 --> 01:08:17.236
Now!

813
01:08:32.210 --> 01:08:33.460
Hyun-seok!

814
01:08:33.642 --> 01:08:36.058
Are you okay? I'm going to you now.

815
01:08:36.215 --> 01:08:38.965
Which way is safe to go?

816
01:08:40.965 --> 01:08:42.715
<i>Which way should I go?</i>

817
01:08:43.632 --> 01:08:44.965
<i>Hyun-hee!</i>

818
01:08:46.799 --> 01:08:47.632
Um...

819
01:08:48.132 --> 01:08:50.299
Keep going straight ahead.

820
01:08:50.299 --> 01:08:51.715
<i>and turn right.</i>

821
01:08:54.632 --> 01:08:55.715
Okay. then what?

822
01:08:57.215 --> 01:08:59.049
This time. go left.

823
01:09:04.620 --> 01:09:06.537
<i>Go straight. then take
the stairs on the right.</i>

824
01:09:06.682 --> 01:09:08.432
<i>No no. stairs on the left!</i>

825
01:09:08.457 --> 01:09:09.457
The left?

826
01:09:09.482 --> 01:09:10.543
Here? Is this right?

827
01:09:10.568 --> 01:09:11.068
<i>Yeah.</i>

828
01:09:11.093 --> 01:09:12.593
<i>Go up those.</i>

829
01:09:14.882 --> 01:09:16.215
Okay. I'm here.

830
01:09:16.465 --> 01:09:18.549
<i>Go out the door and take the elevator.</i>

831
01:09:18.549 --> 01:09:20.299
Here it is!

832
01:09:20.850 --> 01:09:21.933
I'm here!

833
01:09:21.965 --> 01:09:23.132
Are you okay?

834
01:09:26.811 --> 01:09:28.561
Hyun-hee. you made a mistake.

835
01:09:28.586 --> 01:09:31.086
this elevator doesn't
go to the basement.

836
01:09:31.808 --> 01:09:33.725
You're all set now.
Press the 4th floor.

837
01:09:34.541 --> 01:09:36.549
The 4th floor? Get off there?

838
01:09:36.916 --> 01:09:37.999
<i>Hyun-seok...</i>

839
01:09:38.283 --> 01:09:39.024
Then what?

840
01:09:39.337 --> 01:09:40.932
<i>Listen closely to what I say.</i>

841
01:09:41.324 --> 01:09:42.491
<i>From the 4th floor.</i>

842
01:09:42.637 --> 01:09:45.471
<i>go right until you see
an emergency stairway.</i>

843
01:09:45.799 --> 01:09:48.049
Climb up to the 7th floor.

844
01:09:49.382 --> 01:09:53.382
Then you can rejoin the group you left.

845
01:09:55.632 --> 01:09:57.715
<i>What are you talking about?</i>

846
01:09:58.650 --> 01:09:59.816
<i>Hyun-hee!</i>

847
01:10:02.486 --> 01:10:03.196
<i>Tell me quickly.</i>

848
01:10:03.221 --> 01:10:04.524
Hyun-seok. focus!

849
01:10:04.549 --> 01:10:05.465
<i>Hyun-hee!</i>

850
01:10:05.465 --> 01:10:06.298
Hyun-seok!

851
01:10:08.274 --> 01:10:09.610
Get out of here alive.

852
01:10:09.882 --> 01:10:11.215
<i>It's too late for me.</i>

853
01:10:11.480 --> 01:10:13.571
No. it's not too late.

854
01:10:14.557 --> 01:10:17.723
It's not fucking late. I'll go there!

855
01:10:18.832 --> 01:10:20.999
<i>I can go there now.</i>

856
01:10:21.774 --> 01:10:23.107
<i>Just tell me.</i>

857
01:10:23.132 --> 01:10:25.049
We should've gone camping last week.

858
01:10:27.882 --> 01:10:30.049
<i>Go on. I'll hang up now.</i>

859
01:10:30.549 --> 01:10:33.049
Wait. don't.

860
01:10:59.537 --> 01:11:00.870
Wait...

861
01:11:19.564 --> 01:11:20.892
What the hell?

862
01:11:21.447 --> 01:11:22.864
Oh no!

863
01:11:27.066 --> 01:11:28.441
<i>You all killed my
sister. I feel so bad!</i>

864
01:11:29.519 --> 01:11:32.855
<i>I'm going to kill that vaccine.</i>

865
01:11:35.377 --> 01:11:38.753
<i>And you people will
never get out of here alive.</i>

866
01:11:48.827 --> 01:11:49.882
<i>Is there even a plan?</i>

867
01:11:49.907 --> 01:11:50.857
<i>Preventing Spread
is Top Priority - Gov't</i>

868
01:11:50.882 --> 01:11:52.882
<i>My brother is trapped in there.</i>

869
01:11:52.882 --> 01:11:55.132
<i>infected by some chemical weapon.</i>

870
01:11:55.299 --> 01:11:56.965
<i>They can't just leave him there!</i>

871
01:11:56.990 --> 01:11:59.656
<i>Please send in medical
staff or someone right now!</i>

872
01:11:59.681 --> 01:12:03.681
<i>They keep telling us to wait.
but how long can we wait here?</i>

873
01:12:04.161 --> 01:12:05.107
Excuse me. Minister.

874
01:12:05.591 --> 01:12:06.357
They're here.

875
01:12:06.796 --> 01:12:07.796
Dear me.

876
01:12:10.486 --> 01:12:12.069
Thank you for coming.

877
01:12:12.298 --> 01:12:13.381
Just a second.

878
01:12:14.254 --> 01:12:16.671
I think we'll have to talk over there.

879
01:12:17.066 --> 01:12:18.566
Join us. Police Commissioner.

880
01:12:18.799 --> 01:12:19.715
Yes.

881
01:12:24.215 --> 01:12:26.632
I'll get right to the point.

882
01:12:27.064 --> 01:12:28.231
Let's say the people inside

883
01:12:28.256 --> 01:12:30.089
are in a state resembling
those monkeys.

884
01:12:30.334 --> 01:12:33.004
Then what are the chances
they can return to normal?

885
01:12:35.511 --> 01:12:37.357
Well...

886
01:12:37.886 --> 01:12:39.853
right now. we can't say with certainty.

887
01:12:39.878 --> 01:12:40.863
Very unlikely.

888
01:12:43.221 --> 01:12:45.887
What do you mean? Explain it simply.

889
01:12:46.525 --> 01:12:50.441
Nerve cells. once they're destroyed.

890
01:12:51.558 --> 01:12:53.892
cannot be healed or recovered.

891
01:12:55.632 --> 01:12:56.632
Put simply.

892
01:12:57.549 --> 01:13:01.382
once infected. they are
more or less brain dead.

893
01:13:04.050 --> 01:13:06.940
Our squad leader has
Suh Young-chul. right?

894
01:13:07.300 --> 01:13:08.129
Yes. he does.

895
01:13:08.284 --> 01:13:09.784
And the rescue team's on standby.

896
01:13:09.809 --> 01:13:11.475
since they can't hurt the infected.

897
01:13:11.712 --> 01:13:12.527
That's right.

898
01:13:13.848 --> 01:13:15.121
In that case.

899
01:13:15.146 --> 01:13:18.146
as the special investigative
team explained to me just now.

900
01:13:18.524 --> 01:13:20.511
I'd like you to make a
formal announcement.

901
01:13:21.265 --> 01:13:23.215
In particular...

902
01:13:25.183 --> 01:13:28.107
if Professor Gong Sul-hee. a
victim's family member herself.

903
01:13:28.132 --> 01:13:30.715
makes an announcement
about the state of the infected.

904
01:13:30.715 --> 01:13:33.215
citizens may be more
willing to trust her.

905
01:13:34.256 --> 01:13:38.095
You're saying you want justification

906
01:13:38.120 --> 01:13:42.064
to shoot the infected people inside?

907
01:13:42.490 --> 01:13:43.619
With us taking responsibility?

908
01:13:43.730 --> 01:13:47.397
No. no responsibility. You
say it's impossible to treat?

909
01:13:47.854 --> 01:13:49.541
So what's most important is to

910
01:13:49.566 --> 01:13:52.088
secure the vaccine to
stop further spread.

911
01:13:52.113 --> 01:13:53.080
Right?

912
01:13:53.105 --> 01:13:56.517
Everything we've said up
until now is speculation.

913
01:13:56.572 --> 01:13:58.155
Even if they're brain dead.

914
01:13:58.180 --> 01:14:00.314
we need more time
to study it. Minister.

915
01:14:00.339 --> 01:14:01.104
Hold on.

916
01:14:01.502 --> 01:14:02.791
Why are you changing your position?

917
01:14:02.902 --> 01:14:04.190
We're not changing our position.

918
01:14:04.215 --> 01:14:06.346
- We're just stating facts!
- Don't get upset.

919
01:14:07.330 --> 01:14:09.049
- You said there's no way to treat it.
- What we mean is...

920
01:14:09.049 --> 01:14:10.549
I'll do it.

921
01:14:12.715 --> 01:14:15.382
Professor Gong. just a minute.
This isn't right. hold on.

922
01:14:15.799 --> 01:14:17.215
And then...

923
01:14:17.799 --> 01:14:19.882
there's something else you have to do.

924
01:14:20.549 --> 01:14:23.132
Among the monkeys in Suh's lab.

925
01:14:23.465 --> 01:14:25.965
once the one marked #1 was killed.

926
01:14:25.965 --> 01:14:28.632
all the other monkeys stopped moving.

927
01:14:29.753 --> 01:14:31.503
What's that monkey #1?

928
01:14:31.528 --> 01:14:32.862
Based on his records

929
01:14:33.465 --> 01:14:35.386
this was the first
monkey to be infected.

930
01:14:35.754 --> 01:14:37.357
So if we take out the first person

931
01:14:37.382 --> 01:14:39.132
in that building to be infected

932
01:14:39.624 --> 01:14:42.090
all the others will stop
moving. is that right?

933
01:14:43.049 --> 01:14:45.049
Yes. I believe so.

934
01:14:46.210 --> 01:14:47.949
Hold on. in that case..

935
01:14:50.363 --> 01:14:51.582
Let's do this.

936
01:14:52.212 --> 01:14:54.832
Call the security firm in
charge of the building

937
01:14:54.857 --> 01:14:55.988
and get a link to the CCTV.

938
01:14:56.186 --> 01:14:58.519
Let's find out who was
the first to get infected.

939
01:14:58.814 --> 01:15:02.980
Then under the name of Professor Gong.

940
01:15:03.005 --> 01:15:05.338
we'll issue a press release
on the team's findings.

941
01:15:05.363 --> 01:15:06.697
Quickly. okay?

942
01:15:06.722 --> 01:15:09.055
Let's get this moving. Hurry up.

943
01:15:09.944 --> 01:15:11.111
Let's go.

944
01:15:17.705 --> 01:15:19.121
Have you gone mad?

945
01:15:19.382 --> 01:15:22.080
Don't you know if things go
badly. they'll blame it on you?

946
01:15:23.225 --> 01:15:27.314
What's important now
is not who's responsible.

947
01:15:28.861 --> 01:15:30.444
It's stopping more infections.

948
01:16:51.465 --> 01:16:53.799
We're sending you the link to the

949
01:16:53.799 --> 01:16:56.632
Doongwoori Building control room CCTV.

950
01:16:56.882 --> 01:16:58.049
Take a look.

951
01:16:58.274 --> 01:17:02.274
It was about noon yesterday
when the incident occurred.

952
01:17:02.299 --> 01:17:04.869
Thoroughly investigate what
happened in that building.

953
01:17:05.632 --> 01:17:06.775
What we need to find

954
01:17:06.975 --> 01:17:09.642
is the very first person infected
in Suh's terrorist attack.

955
01:17:09.995 --> 01:17:11.080
- Got it?
- Yes. sir.

956
01:17:11.105 --> 01:17:11.814
Let's begin.

957
01:17:46.447 --> 01:17:48.477
<i>...go up stairs to 31st floor lounge.</i>

958
01:17:48.502 --> 01:17:50.623
<i>then take emergency stairway to roof.</i>

959
01:18:14.272 --> 01:18:15.189
There it is.

960
01:18:18.049 --> 01:18:20.882
<i>This is an announcement
of escape routes</i>

961
01:18:20.882 --> 01:18:23.049
<i>in case of fire or emergency</i>

962
01:18:25.882 --> 01:18:27.632
<i>Your current location</i>

963
01:18:28.715 --> 01:18:31.132
<i>is Building A. 31st floor VIP lounge.</i>

964
01:18:31.132 --> 01:18:32.132
Damn it...

965
01:18:35.132 --> 01:18:36.132
Hurry!

966
01:18:53.882 --> 01:18:55.882
What. you killed it?

967
01:18:56.783 --> 01:18:57.639
You said they're patients!

968
01:18:58.623 --> 01:19:00.456
You said we can't kill patients!

969
01:19:02.965 --> 01:19:05.132
What now? Where should we go?

970
01:19:07.632 --> 01:19:08.715
Turn around and run!

971
01:19:08.715 --> 01:19:11.049
Turn around? Come on. hurry!

972
01:19:16.382 --> 01:19:17.715
You asshole!

973
01:19:20.408 --> 01:19:21.241
Hurry!

974
01:19:21.757 --> 01:19:22.924
Save me!

975
01:19:46.049 --> 01:19:46.965
Save me...

976
01:19:48.132 --> 01:19:51.132
You said you're a cop... how could you?

977
01:19:52.715 --> 01:19:54.049
Shit!

978
01:20:38.306 --> 01:20:39.509
Take me. you bastard!

979
01:20:39.534 --> 01:20:40.697
Let go!

980
01:20:40.722 --> 01:20:43.101
Save me!

981
01:20:43.150 --> 01:20:44.566
Let go!

982
01:20:47.382 --> 01:20:48.965
Save me. you asshole!

983
01:20:50.965 --> 01:20:53.118
Let go of me. you bastard!

984
01:20:53.799 --> 01:20:54.969
Let go!

985
01:20:57.821 --> 01:20:58.807
Shit.

986
01:21:06.215 --> 01:21:07.465
For fuck's sake..

987
01:21:34.644 --> 01:21:35.811
What do we do now?

988
01:21:36.132 --> 01:21:37.965
How can we get to the rescue team?

989
01:21:48.665 --> 01:21:51.345
<i>We have to be quiet. Let's
communicate only by texting.</i>

990
01:21:59.181 --> 01:22:00.689
<i>Then what should we do now?</i>

991
01:22:04.965 --> 01:22:06.465
<i>Too dangerous to go to the rescue team.</i>

992
01:22:06.465 --> 01:22:07.916
<i>We need to make them come to us.</i>

993
01:22:10.769 --> 01:22:14.033
<i>How do we contact the rescue team?</i>

994
01:22:19.728 --> 01:22:21.091
What are you talking about?

995
01:22:22.431 --> 01:22:23.847
I want to know. too.

996
01:22:23.872 --> 01:22:25.039
Son of a bitch..

997
01:22:26.425 --> 01:22:27.292
<i>I'll get the dead policeman's phone</i>

998
01:22:27.317 --> 01:22:28.018
<i>and contact the rescue team.</i>

999
01:22:28.043 --> 01:22:28.870
<i>You stay and watch over Suh.</i>

1000
01:22:57.571 --> 01:22:59.300
<i>I'll get the dead policeman's phone</i>

1001
01:22:59.325 --> 01:23:01.332
<i>and contact the rescue team.</i>

1002
01:23:01.887 --> 01:23:03.746
I'll get the dead policeman's phone

1003
01:23:03.771 --> 01:23:05.832
and contact the rescue team.

1004
01:23:10.715 --> 01:23:12.405
I think I found it!

1005
01:23:13.264 --> 01:23:14.155
Put it up on the screen.

1006
01:23:18.882 --> 01:23:20.132
Who is that?

1007
01:23:22.549 --> 01:23:24.049
Kang Woo-cheol.

1008
01:23:24.299 --> 01:23:27.465
Chains Bio CEO Kang Woo-cheol
was the first to be infected.

1009
01:23:27.715 --> 01:23:30.382
Track him and find out where he is now.

1010
01:23:30.549 --> 01:23:31.715
Yes. sir.

1011
01:23:38.937 --> 01:23:40.835
Is she just going to go
off with the rescue team?

1012
01:23:42.183 --> 01:23:44.217
What if she just leaves us behind?

1013
01:23:45.225 --> 01:23:46.642
Don't you get it?

1014
01:23:46.748 --> 01:23:49.248
Without him. the rescue
team's not coming anyway.

1015
01:23:49.644 --> 01:23:51.030
And don't talk for no reason.

1016
01:23:51.752 --> 01:23:53.225
He hears everything we say.

1017
01:23:54.799 --> 01:23:55.202
Fuck.

1018
01:23:55.721 --> 01:23:56.772
We're screwed anyway.

1019
01:23:58.202 --> 01:24:00.820
The cop died. all of them died.

1020
01:24:04.746 --> 01:24:07.475
How can you stay so
calm in this situation?

1021
01:24:10.838 --> 01:24:12.088
Because it was even worse.

1022
01:24:13.977 --> 01:24:17.569
With you and your gang
bullying me. every day was hell.

1023
01:24:18.522 --> 01:24:19.272
Worse than this.

1024
01:24:23.299 --> 01:24:23.944
I'm sorry.

1025
01:24:26.144 --> 01:24:26.577
What?

1026
01:24:28.324 --> 01:24:29.460
I said sorry.

1027
01:24:31.064 --> 01:24:32.694
For everything I did to you.

1028
01:24:35.249 --> 01:24:36.061
All of a sudden?

1029
01:24:38.390 --> 01:24:39.233
Now?

1030
01:24:40.783 --> 01:24:42.577
After all the bullying you did?

1031
01:24:43.736 --> 01:24:46.402
I said. I'm sorry!

1032
01:24:47.050 --> 01:24:48.996
But it's all over now!

1033
01:24:50.215 --> 01:24:52.965
We're going to die here.

1034
01:24:53.866 --> 01:24:55.355
That woman...

1035
01:24:56.597 --> 01:24:58.066
she'll come for us. for sure.

1036
01:24:59.382 --> 01:25:02.074
And we'll get out of here alive.

1037
01:25:03.527 --> 01:25:04.793
So stop crying.

1038
01:25:06.236 --> 01:25:06.879
I'm sorry.

1039
01:25:08.189 --> 01:25:10.347
I'm sorry. So-eun.

1040
01:25:12.607 --> 01:25:14.107
If you want to apologize to me.

1041
01:25:14.132 --> 01:25:15.285
do it properly once this is all over.

1042
01:25:21.049 --> 01:25:22.215
All right.

1043
01:25:52.045 --> 01:25:54.628
<i>Police Commissioner Park Jeong-hwan</i>

1044
01:26:05.416 --> 01:26:06.382
Officer Lee.

1045
01:26:06.627 --> 01:26:07.524
Where are you?

1046
01:26:07.549 --> 01:26:09.215
Do you have Suh with you?

1047
01:26:09.728 --> 01:26:11.024
Your subordinate was killed.

1048
01:26:11.049 --> 01:26:12.799
<i>What? Who are you?</i>

1049
01:26:14.715 --> 01:26:16.132
Who are you?

1050
01:26:16.965 --> 01:26:18.382
My name's Kwon Se-jeong.

1051
01:26:18.715 --> 01:26:21.382
I'm one of the people who've
been holding Suh Young-chul.

1052
01:26:21.767 --> 01:26:23.183
Where is Suh now?

1053
01:26:23.208 --> 01:26:26.019
He's confined in a safe place.

1054
01:26:26.631 --> 01:26:28.605
<i>Send the rescue team to where we are.</i>

1055
01:26:29.962 --> 01:26:31.691
I found the current
location of the first infected!

1056
01:26:32.478 --> 01:26:33.277
Where is it?

1057
01:26:33.452 --> 01:26:34.918
Building C. 15th floor hallway.

1058
01:26:35.590 --> 01:26:36.793
Then what should we do?

1059
01:26:38.465 --> 01:26:40.845
Divide the rescue team on
the roof into two teams.

1060
01:26:41.053 --> 01:26:42.525
<i>One team will secure Suh.</i>

1061
01:26:42.740 --> 01:26:44.627
and the other will go
kill the first infected.

1062
01:26:44.924 --> 01:26:46.666
as the professor said.

1063
01:26:47.402 --> 01:26:50.827
<i>Even if we can't treat them. we
need to secure the vaccine.</i>

1064
01:26:52.132 --> 01:26:54.549
Listen. where is Suh Young-chul now?

1065
01:26:54.574 --> 01:26:55.811
We'll send a rescue team immediately.

1066
01:26:56.299 --> 01:26:59.632
The warehouse in Building
A. 32nd floor. Come quickly.

1067
01:27:54.176 --> 01:27:55.676
Approaching the target.

1068
01:27:55.701 --> 01:27:58.118
Destination is beyond this hallway.

1069
01:28:02.432 --> 01:28:04.432
Infected at 12 o'clock!

1070
01:28:14.599 --> 01:28:15.265
Shoot them.

1071
01:28:20.665 --> 01:28:22.499
<i>Alpha Team. report location.</i>

1072
01:28:23.082 --> 01:28:25.082
Moving to target in Building A.

1073
01:28:38.399 --> 01:28:40.565
Are you in there?
We're the rescue team.

1074
01:28:41.903 --> 01:28:43.986
- They're here!
- Open the door. We're the rescue team.

1075
01:28:44.011 --> 01:28:45.131
Yes!

1076
01:28:45.156 --> 01:28:46.406
Na-yoon!

1077
01:28:48.091 --> 01:28:49.258
We're the rescue team.

1078
01:29:37.446 --> 01:29:38.863
You said you'd apologize?

1079
01:29:40.032 --> 01:29:41.449
Do it now.

1080
01:29:44.865 --> 01:29:45.949
Fuck!

1081
01:29:47.032 --> 01:29:47.865
Go away!

1082
01:29:51.117 --> 01:29:52.617
Stay away. you monster!

1083
01:29:57.032 --> 01:29:58.282
No!

1084
01:30:05.632 --> 01:30:06.382
Clear!

1085
01:30:06.382 --> 01:30:07.965
Passage secured. Re-entering.

1086
01:30:12.882 --> 01:30:14.049
Target in sight!

1087
01:30:14.215 --> 01:30:15.465
There he is. there..

1088
01:30:35.515 --> 01:30:36.624
Huh. why'd it go off?

1089
01:30:36.999 --> 01:30:38.144
Why'd it go off?

1090
01:30:38.169 --> 01:30:38.882
Try connecting again.

1091
01:30:51.702 --> 01:30:52.600
Confirmed dead.

1092
01:30:54.932 --> 01:30:57.099
It's over now. right?

1093
01:30:58.338 --> 01:30:59.475
They've all stopped?

1094
01:31:02.432 --> 01:31:03.682
What's that?

1095
01:31:15.265 --> 01:31:16.599
<i>Requesting backup!</i>

1096
01:31:21.015 --> 01:31:22.099
<i>Requesting backup!</i>

1097
01:31:27.372 --> 01:31:28.788
And Suh Young-chul?

1098
01:31:28.898 --> 01:31:30.398
Isn't that him?

1099
01:31:31.991 --> 01:31:33.075
There!

1100
01:32:28.429 --> 01:32:30.346
Those idiots.

1101
01:34:27.265 --> 01:34:28.432
No!

1102
01:34:33.765 --> 01:34:35.099
Get a grip.

1103
01:34:35.599 --> 01:34:38.849
If you kill Suh now. more
people will be in danger.

1104
01:34:39.182 --> 01:34:41.349
What do I care about that now?

1105
01:34:41.765 --> 01:34:42.599
Hey!

1106
01:34:44.294 --> 01:34:45.544
You people...

1107
01:34:46.280 --> 01:34:48.530
You abandoned my sister!

1108
01:35:09.562 --> 01:35:11.729
Want me to make your wish come true?

1109
01:35:13.197 --> 01:35:14.614
What did you say?

1110
01:35:22.263 --> 01:35:23.263
Hyun-hee?

1111
01:36:21.349 --> 01:36:22.599
Did you see that?

1112
01:36:23.515 --> 01:36:25.265
Doesn't she look much better?

1113
01:36:25.849 --> 01:36:27.432
Professor Kwon?

1114
01:36:29.932 --> 01:36:31.849
You sent this invitation. didn't you?

1115
01:36:33.182 --> 01:36:34.802
My inspiration to create these children

1116
01:36:35.437 --> 01:36:37.489
came from you. Professor Kwon.

1117
01:36:41.499 --> 01:36:44.247
My dad begged you.

1118
01:36:49.127 --> 01:36:50.278
<i>To Prof. Kwon: Imperfect communication.</i>

1119
01:36:50.303 --> 01:36:51.270
<i>the source of all tragedy</i>

1120
01:36:51.295 --> 01:36:53.429
<i>Se-jeong. this is a misunderstanding.</i>

1121
01:36:53.599 --> 01:36:56.265
The law doesn't always
match the actual situation.

1122
01:36:56.932 --> 01:36:59.432
Borrowing the name of
students who didn't take part

1123
01:36:59.515 --> 01:37:02.932
was the only way to pay
students who did participate.

1124
01:37:03.182 --> 01:37:05.015
They all agreed to it.

1125
01:37:05.265 --> 01:37:07.682
No. no. Se-jeong..

1126
01:37:07.682 --> 01:37:11.682
This is a tragedy resulting
from imperfect communication.

1127
01:37:12.765 --> 01:37:13.765
No. please.

1128
01:37:14.182 --> 01:37:15.599
Se-jeong... Se-jeong?

1129
01:37:29.962 --> 01:37:33.212
And so. all of this was
because of that incident?

1130
01:37:34.577 --> 01:37:36.760
If you want revenge. take
it out on me. asshole!

1131
01:37:37.741 --> 01:37:38.603
What revenge?

1132
01:37:40.403 --> 01:37:41.892
My dad's death

1133
01:37:44.182 --> 01:37:47.099
was a tragedy caused by
imperfect communication.

1134
01:37:47.765 --> 01:37:49.932
Not because of someone like you.

1135
01:37:49.932 --> 01:37:53.432
Like you... like you..

1136
01:37:55.515 --> 01:37:58.182
Compared to the great
achievements of mankind.

1137
01:37:58.349 --> 01:37:59.599
the knowledge possessed

1138
01:37:59.599 --> 01:38:01.682
by any individual is
incredibly limited.

1139
01:38:02.265 --> 01:38:07.015
That limitation creates a state
of terrible incomprehension.

1140
01:38:07.935 --> 01:38:10.851
In the end. the way to
stop all such tragedies

1141
01:38:11.349 --> 01:38:15.765
is to connect all of
our minds together.

1142
01:38:17.103 --> 01:38:19.603
The imperfect communication
of human beings.

1143
01:38:20.068 --> 01:38:21.901
all the tragedies that result from

1144
01:38:21.926 --> 01:38:24.260
not fully understanding
what others feel.

1145
01:38:24.765 --> 01:38:27.099
This system is the perfect solution.

1146
01:38:28.111 --> 01:38:30.194
That's what we are.

1147
01:38:32.444 --> 01:38:36.122
What do less evolved beings
like you have over us?

1148
01:38:37.584 --> 01:38:38.145
Ah...

1149
01:38:39.546 --> 01:38:41.208
The freedom to be an outcast?

1150
01:38:43.228 --> 01:38:44.567
Can you handle that. Professor?

1151
01:38:46.682 --> 01:38:48.849
You do this because you can handle it?

1152
01:38:50.241 --> 01:38:52.491
Then go ahead. be an outcast.

1153
01:39:02.872 --> 01:39:04.538
Alpha Team. target located.

1154
01:39:16.349 --> 01:39:18.599
Alpha Team. vaccine
secured! Vaccine secured!

1155
01:39:18.932 --> 01:39:20.932
<i>If target's secured. withdraw quickly!</i>

1156
01:39:52.195 --> 01:39:55.529
Well. it's a shame. but at
least we've got the vaccine.

1157
01:39:58.166 --> 01:39:59.330
Then what about her?

1158
01:40:00.197 --> 01:40:01.650
You're just going to abandon her?

1159
01:40:02.639 --> 01:40:04.447
Send the rescue team back in now!

1160
01:40:05.369 --> 01:40:06.490
Okay. everyone...

1161
01:40:06.853 --> 01:40:08.740
Professor. get some rest. okay?

1162
01:40:08.990 --> 01:40:10.657
I think your job here is done.

1163
01:40:11.267 --> 01:40:13.368
Escort the professor out.
Back to your places.

1164
01:40:13.393 --> 01:40:15.143
- This way. please.
- Let go!

1165
01:40:18.127 --> 01:40:20.074
Alpha Team moving
to Building C Rooftop.

1166
01:40:20.411 --> 01:40:23.077
<i>Roger. Charlie Team ready
to move to adjacent building.</i>

1167
01:40:38.702 --> 01:40:41.257
<i>My Better Half</i>

1168
01:40:46.497 --> 01:40:47.747
Hello?

1169
01:40:47.858 --> 01:40:51.191
<i>Hello? Professor Kwon? Are you okay?</i>

1170
01:40:52.614 --> 01:40:55.197
<i>I know your situation there.</i>

1171
01:40:55.491 --> 01:40:56.692
You know my situation?

1172
01:40:57.971 --> 01:41:01.721
I was watching from the
Counterterrorism HQ.

1173
01:41:02.894 --> 01:41:03.676
I'm sorry.

1174
01:41:04.432 --> 01:41:07.349
<i>I don't think the rescue
team can go back.</i>

1175
01:41:10.231 --> 01:41:12.731
Then why are you calling me?

1176
01:41:15.557 --> 01:41:18.099
I thought I had found a
way to stop the infected.

1177
01:41:18.697 --> 01:41:21.947
There was a group of monkeys
Suh experimented on at his lab.

1178
01:41:22.310 --> 01:41:24.810
<i>When a monkey marked #1 was killed.</i>

1179
01:41:25.074 --> 01:41:27.574
<i>all the other monkeys stopped moving.</i>

1180
01:41:27.817 --> 01:41:28.817
They stopped moving?

1181
01:41:29.333 --> 01:41:31.490
<i>So I thought killing the first infected</i>

1182
01:41:31.890 --> 01:41:33.263
<i>would solve everything...</i>

1183
01:41:41.458 --> 01:41:43.124
The monkey marked #1...

1184
01:41:43.260 --> 01:41:45.343
It's not the first one to be infected.

1185
01:41:45.684 --> 01:41:47.824
It's the monkey that
controls all the others.

1186
01:41:48.036 --> 01:41:50.202
<i>In that case. monkey #1 is</i>

1187
01:41:51.390 --> 01:41:53.057
Suh Young-chul himself.

1188
01:41:53.490 --> 01:41:55.010
Alpha Team arriving at destination.

1189
01:41:56.046 --> 01:41:57.630
Have you ever been shot?

1190
01:41:58.541 --> 01:41:59.624
Eyes forward.

1191
01:42:21.432 --> 01:42:23.099
I'm so sore.

1192
01:42:44.830 --> 01:42:46.580
Tell them to kill Suh
Young-chul immediately.

1193
01:42:46.605 --> 01:42:49.188
<i>That'll stop all of them from moving.</i>

1194
01:42:49.700 --> 01:42:51.731
<i>If Suh gets outside. we're finished!</i>

1195
01:42:52.991 --> 01:42:55.824
<i>We can't. If we kill him now.</i>

1196
01:42:56.294 --> 01:42:58.157
not only the victims' families.

1197
01:42:58.746 --> 01:43:00.786
but everyone scared of getting infected

1198
01:43:00.811 --> 01:43:02.144
will become our enemies.

1199
01:43:02.424 --> 01:43:04.841
<i>The government won't
easily make that decision.</i>

1200
01:43:06.099 --> 01:43:07.932
<i>Can you handle that?</i>

1201
01:43:08.432 --> 01:43:10.765
Then go ahead. be an outcast.

1202
01:43:12.682 --> 01:43:14.349
So that's what he meant.

1203
01:43:30.265 --> 01:43:32.099
Is he really the vaccine?

1204
01:43:33.015 --> 01:43:36.182
Never mind what others
think. what do you think?

1205
01:43:38.932 --> 01:43:40.765
You have to decide.

1206
01:43:56.802 --> 01:43:59.270
<i>Any issues bringing
Suh Young-chul outside?</i>

1207
01:44:00.033 --> 01:44:02.192
No. Suh Young-chul
is coming out safely.

1208
01:44:11.932 --> 01:44:13.599
We need to eliminate Suh Young-chul!

1209
01:44:14.651 --> 01:44:15.885
What are you talking about?

1210
01:44:16.231 --> 01:44:18.397
I called Professor Kwon
who's in the building now.

1211
01:44:18.744 --> 01:44:21.603
and she said Suh is
controlling all of the infected.

1212
01:44:21.852 --> 01:44:22.936
Suh Young-chul is #1!

1213
01:44:22.961 --> 01:44:24.461
We need to kill him.

1214
01:44:25.099 --> 01:44:27.682
Seriously? Kill the vaccine?

1215
01:44:29.510 --> 01:44:30.990
Your responsibility extends only

1216
01:44:31.015 --> 01:44:32.932
to that operation that failed earlier!

1217
01:44:33.439 --> 01:44:35.074
Does anyone have clear evidence

1218
01:44:35.099 --> 01:44:36.924
that we need to kill our only vaccine?

1219
01:44:37.119 --> 01:44:39.017
Anyone? Anyone have it?

1220
01:44:41.682 --> 01:44:45.515
The vaccine is on his way
here now. It's all finished!

1221
01:44:47.932 --> 01:44:50.765
<i>HQ. lifting lockdown here.
One SWAT vehicle moving.</i>

1222
01:44:50.968 --> 01:44:52.802
<i>The vaccine is being
moved to the safe zone.</i>

1223
01:44:53.949 --> 01:44:56.782
HQ. vehicle has entered! I
repeat. vehicle has entered!

1224
01:45:03.932 --> 01:45:05.515
<i>Too many people are gathered in front</i>

1225
01:45:05.515 --> 01:45:07.349
<i>of Doongwoori Building. Support needed.</i>

1226
01:45:07.599 --> 01:45:09.349
<i>Requesting all available personnel</i>

1227
01:45:09.349 --> 01:45:11.099
<i>to be sent to Doongwoori Building.</i>

1228
01:47:09.015 --> 01:47:11.515
Secure the area! Move back!

1229
01:47:12.015 --> 01:47:13.682
Stop. please. Move back.

1230
01:47:13.849 --> 01:47:15.515
Move back. move back!

1231
01:47:47.049 --> 01:47:47.892
Minister!

1232
01:47:54.197 --> 01:47:55.682
The barricade in front of

1233
01:47:55.707 --> 01:47:56.892
Doongwoori Building is being breached!

1234
01:47:57.670 --> 01:47:58.260
What?

1235
01:48:25.817 --> 01:48:26.888
Come on.

1236
01:48:33.624 --> 01:48:35.827
No... we need to get Suh.

1237
01:48:36.455 --> 01:48:37.827
Where are the nearest army units?

1238
01:48:39.061 --> 01:48:42.978
All the troops in Seoul
are mobilized in there.

1239
01:48:44.177 --> 01:48:45.294
Damn it!

1240
01:48:45.739 --> 01:48:48.990
Listen. everyone. Let's
disband for now. okay?

1241
01:48:49.015 --> 01:48:51.599
We'll decide the HQ's
new location later.

1242
01:48:51.624 --> 01:48:53.540
Everyone evacuate. quickly!

1243
01:49:33.512 --> 01:49:34.263
Hello?

1244
01:49:34.965 --> 01:49:36.427
<i>What happened to Suh?</i>

1245
01:49:37.486 --> 01:49:39.520
<i>The people in charge here
are all running away.</i>

1246
01:49:40.130 --> 01:49:41.231
<i>And Suh Young-chul escaped.</i>

1247
01:49:43.444 --> 01:49:46.205
Can you check Suh's location?
You said you saw everything.

1248
01:49:46.593 --> 01:49:48.603
<i>Just a minute. I'll
call you right back.</i>

1249
01:49:50.294 --> 01:49:51.213
Professor Gong.

1250
01:49:52.210 --> 01:49:52.939
Professor Gong!

1251
01:50:04.016 --> 01:50:05.600
Do we know Suh's location?

1252
01:50:05.600 --> 01:50:06.600
What?

1253
01:50:06.932 --> 01:50:08.432
What are you doing?

1254
01:50:08.535 --> 01:50:09.785
You need to evacuate!

1255
01:50:10.016 --> 01:50:11.850
There's no time! Go. quickly!

1256
01:50:24.445 --> 01:50:25.328
<i>I found him.</i>

1257
01:50:26.433 --> 01:50:28.433
He's at 32 Sinsok Street.
on the main road.

1258
01:50:32.120 --> 01:50:33.433
<i>See the car with blinking lights?</i>

1259
01:50:34.359 --> 01:50:34.995
I see it.

1260
01:50:35.390 --> 01:50:36.640
<i>I'm watching.</i>

1261
01:50:39.563 --> 01:50:40.781
Tell me which way to go.

1262
01:50:48.162 --> 01:50:49.591
Keep going straight.

1263
01:50:51.998 --> 01:50:53.107
Left at the intersection.

1264
01:50:59.350 --> 01:51:00.850
Turn right at the next intersection.

1265
01:53:09.600 --> 01:53:11.516
That idiot. covering himself in that...

1266
01:53:18.850 --> 01:53:20.016
Move!

1267
01:53:22.516 --> 01:53:24.600
Out of the way!

1268
01:53:50.516 --> 01:53:51.766
<i>They've reverted to
their original state.</i>

1269
01:54:38.433 --> 01:54:40.516
Stop! Stop. you bastards!

1270
01:54:41.100 --> 01:54:42.516
Stop!

1271
01:54:55.100 --> 01:54:57.350
Please stop!

1272
01:55:03.600 --> 01:55:04.433
Stop!

1273
01:55:04.814 --> 01:55:06.064
Please...

1274
01:56:54.807 --> 01:56:55.401
<i>Yes?</i>

1275
01:56:55.557 --> 01:56:57.807
How's it in other places?
Was it successful?

1276
01:56:59.011 --> 01:56:59.543
Yes.

1277
01:57:00.922 --> 01:57:01.948
They've stopped.

1278
01:57:04.037 --> 01:57:05.703
You did it.

1279
01:57:06.766 --> 01:57:09.516
I doubt people will see it that way.

1280
01:57:10.350 --> 01:57:11.850
What should we do?

1281
01:57:12.016 --> 01:57:14.183
<i>The vaccine's gone for good now.</i>

1282
01:57:14.183 --> 01:57:16.183
<i>Everyone's going to hate me.</i>

1283
01:57:17.600 --> 01:57:18.933
Don't worry.

1284
01:57:19.100 --> 01:57:21.600
I'll testify with you.

1285
01:57:22.100 --> 01:57:25.433
If you're going to be hated.
I'll take it with you.

1286
01:57:31.183 --> 01:57:33.016
No need for that.

1287
01:57:33.183 --> 01:57:34.933
I'm used to people hating me.

1288
01:57:36.933 --> 01:57:38.683
<i>Where are you now?</i>

1289
01:57:39.933 --> 01:57:42.516
<i>I guess we have a lot
of work ahead of us.</i>

1290
01:57:43.305 --> 01:58:43.211
Watch Online Movies and Series for FREE
www.osdb.link/lm
